window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/b270-0426d490798248c3.json"]={sha256:"0426d490798248c3b1f5e043395ef1faecc758a96602f3b6d1d274ff6cc5887e",value:{"id":"b270","title":"防洪抽水站機組整合","titleEn":"Flood-pumping-station integration","category":"water","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"本課由內水收支與系統揚程進入並聯泵、效率、變速、啟停及吸入條件，再串接電源、閘門與備援能力。上環與西部封閉綜合工程提供不同尺度的實例，所有算例為原創簡化條件；課程要求可追溯驗證與失效界面分析，不將教學數字當現場操作設定。","summaryEn":"The course moves from interior-water balance and system head to parallel units, efficiency, speed, cycling and suction conditions, then integrates power, gates and retained capacity. Sheung Wan and the West Closure Complex provide examples at different scales. Every calculation is an original simplification, requiring traceable verification and interface analysis rather than treating lesson values as field operating settings.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、開挖、注漿或受限空間作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, excavation, grouting or confined-space permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"water-rivers","subcategoryTitle":"輸配水、河川與都市防洪","subcategoryTitleEn":"Water conveyance, rivers and urban flood protection","learningTrack":"water","learningSubdiscipline":"water-rivers","learningTags":["water","water-rivers","water"],"architectureFamily":"water-river","architectureNodes":[["雨洪與儲水","Runoff and storage"],["機組與管路","Pumps and pipes"],["閘門防倒灌","Backflow gates"],["供電與控制","Power and control"],["故障驗證","Failure verification"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4]],"diagram":{"type":"water-river","labels":["雨洪與儲水","機組與管路","閘門防倒灌","供電與控制","故障驗證"],"labelsEn":["Runoff and storage","Pumps and pipes","Backflow gates","Power and control","Failure verification"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"敏感度沿用兩台相同泵的Hp=10−0.25q²與系統H=Hs+0.20Q²，流量以m³/s、揚程以m表示且Q=2q。靜揚程Hs由3.0增至3.3 m，增加10%，兩台總流量由5.164降至5.052 m³/s，約減少2.17%。此例不是說所有外水位上升都只減少少量排水，而是展示實際變化由泵與系統曲線共同決定；若新交點超出允許工況，簡化曲線就不能繼續外推。效率、電功率、汽蝕及儲水演算需在新工作點重新檢查。","textEn":"Use two identical pumps with Hp=10−0.25q² and system H=Hs+0.20Q², flows in m³/s, heads in meters and Q=2q. Increasing static head Hs from 3.0 to 3.3 m, or ten percent, reduces combined flow from 5.164 to 5.052 m³/s, approximately 2.17%. This does not imply that rising receiving water always causes only a small drainage loss. It demonstrates that the response follows both pump and system curves. A new intersection outside allowable operation invalidates extrapolation of the simplified curve. Efficiency, electrical power, cavitation and storage routing all need reassessment at the new operating point.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":15,"enrichmentVersion":15,"stages":[{"id":"b270-v15-s1","title":"水文條件、邊界與工程系統","titleEn":"Hydrology, boundaries and engineering system","description":"本階段聚焦「內水蓄積與抽排收支機理與驗證」與「系統揚程與外水位機理與驗證」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Interior storage and pumping balance mechanism and verification\" and \"System head and receiving stage mechanism and verification\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b270-v15-01","title":"內水蓄積與抽排收支機理與驗證：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Interior storage and pumping balance mechanism and verification: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「內水蓄積與抽排收支」如何影響防洪抽水站機組整合的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Interior storage and pumping balance” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Flood-pumping-station integration”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"防洪抽水站處理的是隨時間進入低窪區的水量，而不是單一固定流量。外河高水位關閉重力出口時，集水池與上游管網共同儲存未排出的水，水位上升速度取決於淨入流和有效面積；抽水能力需要與降雨逕流、儲水曲線和外水位成組分析，不能只比較泵銘牌與最大入流。本例在短時間內固定面積和進出流量，假設沒有其他溢流或滲流；不是整場洪水演算，也未描述管網局部積水。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「內水蓄積與抽排收支」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A flood station handles a time-varying inflow rather than one fixed discharge. When high receiving water closes a gravity outlet, the sump and upstream network store unremoved water; rise rate depends on net inflow and effective surface area. Pumping must be evaluated with runoff, storage curves and receiving stage rather than merely comparing nameplate capacity with peak inflow. The short-step example fixes area and flows and excludes other overflow or seepage. It is neither full-event routing nor a description of local network flooding. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Interior storage and pumping balance” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設入流Qi=6、抽排Qp=4 m³/s、時間Δt=300 s、有效面積A=600 m²，水位升幅Δh=(Qi−Qp)Δt/A=1.00 m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume inflow Qi=6, pumping Qp=4 m³/s, Δt=300 s and effective area A=600 m².","failure":"常見誤解：「泵的標示總流量大於平均雨水流量，就能保證任何洪水不積水。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Total labeled pump flow above mean runoff guarantees no flooding in any event.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「內水蓄積與抽排收支」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Interior storage and pumping balance”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-01-k1","title":"內水蓄積與抽排收支機理與驗證","titleEn":"Interior storage and pumping balance mechanism and verification","text":"防洪抽水站處理的是隨時間進入低窪區的水量，而不是單一固定流量。外河高水位關閉重力出口時，集水池與上游管網共同儲存未排出的水，水位上升速度取決於淨入流和有效面積；抽水能力需要與降雨逕流、儲水曲線和外水位成組分析，不能只比較泵銘牌與最大入流。","textEn":"A flood station handles a time-varying inflow rather than one fixed discharge. When high receiving water closes a gravity outlet, the sump and upstream network store unremoved water; rise rate depends on net inflow and effective surface area.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：泵的標示總流量大於平均雨水流量，就能保證任何洪水不積水。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Total labeled pump flow above mean runoff guarantees no flooding in any event. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「內水蓄積與抽排收支機理與驗證」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Interior storage and pumping balance mechanism and verification\" is correct?","options":["泵的標示總流量大於平均雨水流量，就能保證任何洪水不積水。","防洪抽水站處理的是隨時間進入低窪區的水量，而不是單一固定流量。","防洪泵在所有外河水位下都會維持同一銘牌流量。"],"optionsEn":["Total labeled pump flow above mean runoff guarantees no flooding in any event.","A flood station handles a time-varying inflow rather than one fixed discharge.","A flood pump maintains the same nameplate flow at every receiving-river level."],"answer":1,"explanation":"防洪抽水站處理的是隨時間進入低窪區的水量，而不是單一固定流量。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A flood station handles a time-varying inflow rather than one fixed discharge. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b270-v15-02","title":"內水蓄積與抽排收支機理與驗證：定量估算","titleEn":"Interior storage and pumping balance mechanism and verification: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「內水蓄積與抽排收支」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Interior storage and pumping balance” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設入流Qi=6、抽排Qp=4 m³/s、時間Δt=300 s、有效面積A=600 m²，水位升幅Δh=(Qi−Qp)Δt/A=1.00 m。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume inflow Qi=6, pumping Qp=4 m³/s, Δt=300 s and effective area A=600 m². Rise Δh=(Qi−Qp)Δt/A=1.00 m. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以同步雨量、入流、泵流量和池水位核對每個時間步的體積收支，確認有效面積是否隨水位改變。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Reconcile stepwise volumes with synchronized rainfall, inflow, pumping and sump level, checking whether effective area changes with stage.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設入流Qi=6、抽排Qp=4 m³/s、時間Δt=300 s、有效面積A=600 m²，水位升幅Δh=(Qi−Qp)Δt/A=1.00 m。","textEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume inflow Qi=6, pumping Qp=4 m³/s, Δt=300 s and effective area A=600 m². Rise Δh=(Qi−Qp)Δt/A=1.00 m.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「內水蓄積與抽排收支機理與驗證」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Interior storage and pumping balance mechanism and verification\", which statement holds?","options":["水力功率就是抽水站電表功率，不必計入馬達和泵的損失。","啟停週期等於調節容積除以泵流量，入流大小完全無關。","原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設入流Qi=6、抽排Qp=4 m³/s、時間Δt=300 s、有效面積A=600 m²，水位升幅Δh=(Qi−Qp)Δt/A=1.00 m。"],"optionsEn":["Hydraulic power equals metered station power without pump or motor losses.","The start-stop cycle equals regulating volume divided by pump flow and is independent of inflow.","Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume inflow Qi=6, pumping Qp=4 m³/s, Δt=300 s and effective area A=600 m²."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設入流Qi=6、抽排Qp=4 m³/s、時間Δt=300 s、有效面積A=600 m²，水位升幅Δh=(Qi−Qp)Δt/A=1.00 m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume inflow Qi=6, pumping Qp=4 m³/s, Δt=300 s and effective area A=600 m². Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b270-v15-03","title":"內水蓄積與抽排收支機理與驗證：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Interior storage and pumping balance mechanism and verification: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「內水蓄積與抽排收支」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Interior storage and pumping balance” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以同步雨量、入流、泵流量和池水位核對每個時間步的體積收支，確認有效面積是否隨水位改變。將溢流、重力排水與閘門狀態分開記錄，避免把未知出口造成的差額歸因感測誤差。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Reconcile stepwise volumes with synchronized rainfall, inflow, pumping and sump level, checking whether effective area changes with stage. Record overflow, gravity discharge and gate state separately so that an unrecognized outlet is not incorrectly absorbed into a sensor-error correction. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：建立五分鐘體積帳並逐步更新池水位，讓其中一段抽排量降低。指出峰值入流比較與全事件體積演算各會發現什麼問題，並標記需要水位面積曲線的區段。","observationEn":"Site practice: Build a five-minute volume ledger with sequential stage updates and reduce pumping during one interval. Explain the different problems revealed by peak-flow comparison and full-event volume routing, marking where a stage-area curve becomes necessary.","failure":"注意干擾：只用最大泵量而忽略高外水位的實際工況會高估抽排，漏掉上游管網蓄水則可能錯估池水位變化；淨入流長時間為正時，有限儲量終究會耗盡。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Using maximum pump flow without the high-tailwater operating point overstates drainage. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以同步雨量、入流、泵流量和池水位核對每個時間步的體積收支，確認有效面積是否隨水位改變。將溢流、重力排水與閘門狀態分開記錄，避免把未知出口造成的差額歸因感測誤差。","textEn":"Reconcile stepwise volumes with synchronized rainfall, inflow, pumping and sump level, checking whether effective area changes with stage. Record overflow, gravity discharge and gate state separately so that an unrecognized outlet is not incorrectly absorbed into a sensor-error correction.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"建立五分鐘體積帳並逐步更新池水位，讓其中一段抽排量降低。指出峰值入流比較與全事件體積演算各會發現什麼問題，並標記需要水位面積曲線的區段。","textEn":"Build a five-minute volume ledger with sequential stage updates and reduce pumping during one interval. Explain the different problems revealed by peak-flow comparison and full-event volume routing, marking where a stage-area curve becomes necessary.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「內水蓄積與抽排收支機理與驗證」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Interior storage and pumping balance mechanism and verification\"?","options":["以同步雨量、入流、泵流量和池水位核對每個時間步的體積收支，確認有效面積是否隨水位改變。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","備援電源連續千瓦足夠，就代表所有泵可以同時順利啟動。"],"optionsEn":["Reconcile stepwise volumes with synchronized rainfall, inflow, pumping and sump level, checking whether effective area changes with stage.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Adequate continuous backup kilowatts guarantee that all pumps can start simultaneously."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以同步雨量、入流、泵流量和池水位核對每個時間步的體積收支，確認有效面積是否隨水位改變。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Reconcile stepwise volumes with synchronized rainfall, inflow, pumping and sump level, checking whether effective area changes with stage. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b270-v15-04","title":"內水蓄積與抽排收支機理與驗證：失效診斷","titleEn":"Interior storage and pumping balance mechanism and verification: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「內水蓄積與抽排收支」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Interior storage and pumping balance” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"只用最大泵量而忽略高外水位的實際工況會高估抽排，漏掉上游管網蓄水則可能錯估池水位變化；淨入流長時間為正時，有限儲量終究會耗盡。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Using maximum pump flow without the high-tailwater operating point overstates drainage. Omitting upstream network storage distorts sump response, and persistently positive net inflow eventually exhausts finite available storage. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：本例在短時間內固定面積和進出流量，假設沒有其他溢流或滲流；不是整場洪水演算，也未描述管網局部積水。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: It is neither full-event routing nor a description of local network flooding.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「泵的標示總流量大於平均雨水流量，就能保證任何洪水不積水。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Total labeled pump flow above mean runoff guarantees no flooding in any event.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只用最大泵量而忽略高外水位的實際工況會高估抽排，漏掉上游管網蓄水則可能錯估池水位變化；淨入流長時間為正時，有限儲量終究會耗盡。","textEn":"Using maximum pump flow without the high-tailwater operating point overstates drainage. Omitting upstream network storage distorts sump response, and persistently positive net inflow eventually exhausts finite available storage.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「內水蓄積與抽排收支機理與驗證」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Interior storage and pumping balance mechanism and verification\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","只用最大泵量而忽略高外水位的實際工況會高估抽排，漏掉上游管網蓄水則可能錯估池水位變化；淨入流長時間為正時，有限儲量終究會耗盡。","防洪泵在所有外河水位下都會維持同一銘牌流量。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Using maximum pump flow without the high-tailwater operating point overstates drainage.","A flood pump maintains the same nameplate flow at every receiving-river level."],"answer":1,"explanation":"只用最大泵量而忽略高外水位的實際工況會高估抽排，漏掉上游管網蓄水則可能錯估池水位變化；淨入流長時間為正時，有限儲量終究會耗盡。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using maximum pump flow without the high-tailwater operating point overstates drainage. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b270-v15-05","title":"系統揚程與外水位機理與驗證：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"System head and receiving stage mechanism and verification: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-04"],"objective":"說明「系統揚程與外水位」如何影響防洪抽水站機組整合的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “System head and receiving stage” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Flood-pumping-station integration”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"泵需要克服內外水面差與管路損失，外河或海潮升高會改變系統曲線並移動工作點。靜揚程可隨內水位上升而降低，但摩阻通常隨流量增加，兩者不能混成固定總揚程；不同閘門與出口狀態也會改變損失，需為代表工況建立一致的能量帳。本例用二次損失近似固定配置的系統曲線，係數帶有單位；不涵蓋氣塞、虹吸建立或瞬變逆流。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「系統揚程與外水位」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A pump overcomes the difference between interior and receiving surfaces plus hydraulic losses. Rising river or tide shifts the system curve and operating point. Static head can decrease as the sump rises, while friction generally increases with flow; they cannot be collapsed into one fixed total head. Gate and outlet states also require separate, consistent energy balances. The example uses a quadratic loss approximation for a fixed configuration, with a dimensional coefficient. It excludes trapped air, siphon establishment and transient reverse flow. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “System head and receiving stage” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設靜揚程Hs=3.0 m、損失係數K=0.20 s²/m⁵、流量Q=4.0 m³/s，Hsys=Hs+KQ²=6.20 m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume static head Hs=3.0 m, loss coefficient K=0.20 s²/m⁵ and flow Q=4.0 m³/s.","failure":"常見誤解：「防洪泵在所有外河水位下都會維持同一銘牌流量。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A flood pump maintains the same nameplate flow at every receiving-river level.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「系統揚程與外水位」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “System head and receiving stage”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-05-k1","title":"系統揚程與外水位機理與驗證","titleEn":"System head and receiving stage mechanism and verification","text":"泵需要克服內外水面差與管路損失，外河或海潮升高會改變系統曲線並移動工作點。靜揚程可隨內水位上升而降低，但摩阻通常隨流量增加，兩者不能混成固定總揚程；不同閘門與出口狀態也會改變損失，需為代表工況建立一致的能量帳。","textEn":"A pump overcomes the difference between interior and receiving surfaces plus hydraulic losses. Rising river or tide shifts the system curve and operating point.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：防洪泵在所有外河水位下都會維持同一銘牌流量。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A flood pump maintains the same nameplate flow at every receiving-river level. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「系統揚程與外水位機理與驗證」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"System head and receiving stage mechanism and verification\" is correct?","options":["防洪泵在所有外河水位下都會維持同一銘牌流量。","兩台並聯泵的實際排水量必定是單台接原管路時的兩倍。","泵需要克服內外水面差與管路損失，外河或海潮升高會改變系統曲線並移動工作點。"],"optionsEn":["A flood pump maintains the same nameplate flow at every receiving-river level.","Two parallel pumps always deliver twice the single-pump flow through the original system.","A pump overcomes the difference between interior and receiving surfaces plus hydraulic losses."],"answer":2,"explanation":"泵需要克服內外水面差與管路損失，外河或海潮升高會改變系統曲線並移動工作點。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A pump overcomes the difference between interior and receiving surfaces plus hydraulic losses. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b270-v15-06","title":"系統揚程與外水位機理與驗證：定量估算","titleEn":"System head and receiving stage mechanism and verification: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「系統揚程與外水位」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “System head and receiving stage” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設靜揚程Hs=3.0 m、損失係數K=0.20 s²/m⁵、流量Q=4.0 m³/s，Hsys=Hs+KQ²=6.20 m。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume static head Hs=3.0 m, loss coefficient K=0.20 s²/m⁵ and flow Q=4.0 m³/s. System head Hsys=Hs+KQ²=6.20 m. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：量測內外水位並核對同一高程基準，將流量、閥位及壓差配對以辨認系統損失。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure interior and receiving stages on one datum, pairing flow, valve position and pressure difference to identify system losses.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設靜揚程Hs=3.0 m、損失係數K=0.20 s²/m⁵、流量Q=4.0 m³/s，Hsys=Hs+KQ²=6.20 m。","textEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume static head Hs=3.0 m, loss coefficient K=0.20 s²/m⁵ and flow Q=4.0 m³/s. System head Hsys=Hs+KQ²=6.20 m.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「系統揚程與外水位機理與驗證」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"System head and receiving stage mechanism and verification\", which statement holds?","options":["原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設靜揚程Hs=3.0 m、損失係數K=0.20 s²/m⁵、流量Q=4.0 m³/s，Hsys=Hs+KQ²=6.20 m。","泵降速一成，整站一定同時少抽一成水且省下固定立方比例電力。","池水位只要夠高，任何機組組合都不可能出現渦流或汽蝕。"],"optionsEn":["Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume static head Hs=3.0 m, loss coefficient K=0.20 s²/m⁵ and flow Q=4.0 m³/s.","Reducing speed ten percent guarantees ten percent less station flow and fixed cube-law energy savings.","Sufficient sump level makes vortices or cavitation impossible for every pump combination."],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設靜揚程Hs=3.0 m、損失係數K=0.20 s²/m⁵、流量Q=4.0 m³/s，Hsys=Hs+KQ²=6.20 m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume static head Hs=3.0 m, loss coefficient K=0.20 s²/m⁵ and flow Q=4.0 m³/s. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b270-v15-07","title":"系統揚程與外水位機理與驗證：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"System head and receiving stage mechanism and verification: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「系統揚程與外水位」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “System head and receiving stage” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"量測內外水位並核對同一高程基準，將流量、閥位及壓差配對以辨認系統損失。分別檢查高外水位、低內水位及部分堵塞工況，不把單次測試曲線直接套用全部事件。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure interior and receiving stages on one datum, pairing flow, valve position and pressure difference to identify system losses. Examine high tailwater, low sump level and partial blockage separately rather than applying one test curve unchanged to every storm condition. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：畫出兩種外水位的系統曲線，保持管路損失係數不變。說明曲線移動如何影響與泵曲線的交點，再列出哪些構件改變會使係數也必須更新。","observationEn":"Site practice: Draw system curves for two receiving stages while holding the loss coefficient fixed. Explain their changed intersections with the pump curve, then identify component changes that would also require updating the coefficient.","failure":"注意干擾：把外水位忽略會在最需要抽排時高估流量，將靜揚程當成全部揚程又會低估摩阻；出口堵塞或閥位改變可使原有工作點預測失效。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Omitting tailwater overstates flow when drainage is most needed, while treating static head as total head understates friction. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"量測內外水位並核對同一高程基準，將流量、閥位及壓差配對以辨認系統損失。分別檢查高外水位、低內水位及部分堵塞工況，不把單次測試曲線直接套用全部事件。","textEn":"Measure interior and receiving stages on one datum, pairing flow, valve position and pressure difference to identify system losses. Examine high tailwater, low sump level and partial blockage separately rather than applying one test curve unchanged to every storm condition.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"畫出兩種外水位的系統曲線，保持管路損失係數不變。說明曲線移動如何影響與泵曲線的交點，再列出哪些構件改變會使係數也必須更新。","textEn":"Draw system curves for two receiving stages while holding the loss coefficient fixed. Explain their changed intersections with the pump curve, then identify component changes that would also require updating the coefficient.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「系統揚程與外水位機理與驗證」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"System head and receiving stage mechanism and verification\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","量測內外水位並核對同一高程基準，將流量、閥位及壓差配對以辨認系統損失。","閘門兩側淨水壓只需把水位差平方，與各側實際水深無關。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Measure interior and receiving stages on one datum, pairing flow, valve position and pressure difference to identify system losses.","Net gate pressure depends only on squared level difference, not the individual water depths."],"answer":1,"explanation":"量測內外水位並核對同一高程基準，將流量、閥位及壓差配對以辨認系統損失。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure interior and receiving stages on one datum, pairing flow, valve position and pressure difference to identify system losses. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b270-v15-08","title":"系統揚程與外水位機理與驗證：失效診斷","titleEn":"System head and receiving stage mechanism and verification: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「系統揚程與外水位」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “System head and receiving stage” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把外水位忽略會在最需要抽排時高估流量，將靜揚程當成全部揚程又會低估摩阻；出口堵塞或閥位改變可使原有工作點預測失效。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Omitting tailwater overstates flow when drainage is most needed, while treating static head as total head understates friction. Outlet blockage or changed valve position can invalidate the originally predicted operating point. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：本例用二次損失近似固定配置的系統曲線，係數帶有單位；不涵蓋氣塞、虹吸建立或瞬變逆流。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: It excludes trapped air, siphon establishment and transient reverse flow.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「防洪泵在所有外河水位下都會維持同一銘牌流量。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A flood pump maintains the same nameplate flow at every receiving-river level.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把外水位忽略會在最需要抽排時高估流量，將靜揚程當成全部揚程又會低估摩阻；出口堵塞或閥位改變可使原有工作點預測失效。","textEn":"Omitting tailwater overstates flow when drainage is most needed, while treating static head as total head understates friction. Outlet blockage or changed valve position can invalidate the originally predicted operating point.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「系統揚程與外水位機理與驗證」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"System head and receiving stage mechanism and verification\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","兩台並聯泵的實際排水量必定是單台接原管路時的兩倍。","把外水位忽略會在最需要抽排時高估流量，將靜揚程當成全部揚程又會低估摩阻；出口堵塞或閥位改變可使原有工作點預測失效。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Two parallel pumps always deliver twice the single-pump flow through the original system.","Omitting tailwater overstates flow when drainage is most needed, while treating static head as total head understates friction."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把外水位忽略會在最需要抽排時高估流量，將靜揚程當成全部揚程又會低估摩阻；出口堵塞或閥位改變可使原有工作點預測失效。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Omitting tailwater overstates flow when drainage is most needed, while treating static head as total head understates friction. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b270-v15-s2","title":"水力機制、材料與定量模型","titleEn":"Hydraulics, materials and quantitative models","description":"本階段聚焦「並聯機組與共同管路機理與驗證」與「電功率與效率鏈機理與驗證」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Parallel pumps and common pipework mechanism and verification\" and \"Electrical power and efficiency chain mechanism and verification\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b270-v15-09","title":"並聯機組與共同管路機理與驗證：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Parallel pumps and common pipework mechanism and verification: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-08"],"objective":"說明「並聯機組與共同管路」如何影響防洪抽水站機組整合的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Parallel pumps and common pipework” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Flood-pumping-station integration”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"並聯泵在相同揚程下疊加流量，但共同管路的摩阻會隨總流量增加，因此加開第二台通常不會使站流量正好加倍。不同機組曲線、止回閥及局部損失還可能造成不均分流，甚至讓一台落在不利區域；整合時須同時解機組與系統曲線，而不是把型錄數字相加。以下兩台完全相同且均分流量，泵曲線與系統曲線均為教學二次式；沒有替代實機穩定區、效率及汽蝕檢查。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「並聯機組與共同管路」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Parallel pumps add flow at a common head, but shared-pipe friction grows with total flow, so a second pump generally does not double station discharge. Different unit curves, check valves and local losses can create uneven sharing or an unfavorable operating region. Integration therefore solves pump and system curves together rather than adding catalog values. The two units are identical and share flow equally, with hypothetical quadratic pump and system curves. This does not replace real-machine stability, efficiency or cavitation checks. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Parallel pumps and common pipework” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設單泵Hp=10−0.25q² m、系統Hs=3+0.20Q² m，q、Q以m³/s計；兩泵Q=2q得Q=2√(7/1.05)=5.164 m³/s。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume pump Hp=10−0.25q² m and system Hs=3+0.20Q² m, with q,Q in m³/s.","failure":"常見誤解：「兩台並聯泵的實際排水量必定是單台接原管路時的兩倍。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Two parallel pumps always deliver twice the single-pump flow through the original system.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「並聯機組與共同管路」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Parallel pumps and common pipework”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-09-k1","title":"並聯機組與共同管路機理與驗證","titleEn":"Parallel pumps and common pipework mechanism and verification","text":"並聯泵在相同揚程下疊加流量，但共同管路的摩阻會隨總流量增加，因此加開第二台通常不會使站流量正好加倍。不同機組曲線、止回閥及局部損失還可能造成不均分流，甚至讓一台落在不利區域；整合時須同時解機組與系統曲線，而不是把型錄數字相加。","textEn":"Parallel pumps add flow at a common head, but shared-pipe friction grows with total flow, so a second pump generally does not double station discharge. Different unit curves, check valves and local losses can create uneven sharing or an unfavorable operating region.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：兩台並聯泵的實際排水量必定是單台接原管路時的兩倍。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Two parallel pumps always deliver twice the single-pump flow through the original system. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「並聯機組與共同管路機理與驗證」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Parallel pumps and common pipework mechanism and verification\" is correct?","options":["並聯泵在相同揚程下疊加流量，但共同管路的摩阻會隨總流量增加，因此加開第二台通常不會使站流量正好加倍。","兩台並聯泵的實際排水量必定是單台接原管路時的兩倍。","水力功率就是抽水站電表功率，不必計入馬達和泵的損失。"],"optionsEn":["Parallel pumps add flow at a common head, but shared-pipe friction grows with total flow, so a second pump generally does not double station discharge.","Two parallel pumps always deliver twice the single-pump flow through the original system.","Hydraulic power equals metered station power without pump or motor losses."],"answer":0,"explanation":"並聯泵在相同揚程下疊加流量，但共同管路的摩阻會隨總流量增加，因此加開第二台通常不會使站流量正好加倍。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Parallel pumps add flow at a common head, but shared-pipe friction grows with total flow, so a second pump generally does not double station discharge. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b270-v15-10","title":"並聯機組與共同管路機理與驗證：定量估算","titleEn":"Parallel pumps and common pipework mechanism and verification: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「並聯機組與共同管路」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Parallel pumps and common pipework” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設單泵Hp=10−0.25q² m、系統Hs=3+0.20Q² m，q、Q以m³/s計；兩泵Q=2q得Q=2√(7/1.05)=5.164 m³/s。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume pump Hp=10−0.25q² m and system Hs=3+0.20Q² m, with q,Q in m³/s. Two pumps give Q=2q=2√(7/1.05)=5.164 m³/s. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以每台支路流量、共同揚程及轉速驗證分流，核對曲線使用的流量單位與機組組合。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Verify sharing from individual branch flows, common head and speed, checking curve units and pump combinations.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設單泵Hp=10−0.25q² m、系統Hs=3+0.20Q² m，q、Q以m³/s計；兩泵Q=2q得Q=2√(7/1.05)=5.164 m³/s。","textEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume pump Hp=10−0.25q² m and system Hs=3+0.20Q² m, with q,Q in m³/s. Two pumps give Q=2q=2√(7/1.05)=5.164 m³/s.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「並聯機組與共同管路機理與驗證」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Parallel pumps and common pipework mechanism and verification\", which statement holds?","options":["啟停週期等於調節容積除以泵流量，入流大小完全無關。","原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設單泵Hp=10−0.25q² m、系統Hs=3+0.20Q² m，q、Q以m³/s計。","備援電源連續千瓦足夠，就代表所有泵可以同時順利啟動。"],"optionsEn":["The start-stop cycle equals regulating volume divided by pump flow and is independent of inflow.","Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume pump Hp=10−0.25q² m and system Hs=3+0.20Q² m, with q,Q in m³/s.","Adequate continuous backup kilowatts guarantee that all pumps can start simultaneously."],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設單泵Hp=10−0.25q² m、系統Hs=3+0.20Q² m，q、Q以m³/s計；兩泵Q=2q得Q=2√(7/1.05)=5.164 m³/s。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume pump Hp=10−0.25q² m and system Hs=3+0.20Q² m, with q,Q in m³/s. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b270-v15-11","title":"並聯機組與共同管路機理與驗證：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Parallel pumps and common pipework mechanism and verification: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「並聯機組與共同管路」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Parallel pumps and common pipework” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以每台支路流量、共同揚程及轉速驗證分流，核對曲線使用的流量單位與機組組合。比較單台及多台實測交點，檢查止回閥開啟與低流量穩定性，再評估剩餘備援能力。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Verify sharing from individual branch flows, common head and speed, checking curve units and pump combinations. Compare measured single- and multiple-unit intersections, inspect check-valve opening and low-flow stability, and only then assess the drainage capability retained under backup arrangements. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：先解單台交點，再解兩台交點並比較增加比例。將一台泵曲線稍微下移，說明均分流量假設為何不再成立，以及需要補量測哪個支路。","observationEn":"Site practice: Solve single- and two-pump intersections and compare the increase. Shift one pump curve downward slightly, explaining why equal sharing then fails and which branch measurements would be needed to determine the new distribution.","failure":"注意干擾：直接把單台工況流量乘台數會忽略共同摩阻，異型泵也可能出現分流失衡；名義總容量足夠時，某台仍可能偏離允許運轉區而增加振動或過熱。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Multiplying a single-unit operating flow by unit count ignores shared friction, and dissimilar pumps may share unevenly. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以每台支路流量、共同揚程及轉速驗證分流，核對曲線使用的流量單位與機組組合。比較單台及多台實測交點，檢查止回閥開啟與低流量穩定性，再評估剩餘備援能力。","textEn":"Verify sharing from individual branch flows, common head and speed, checking curve units and pump combinations. Compare measured single- and multiple-unit intersections, inspect check-valve opening and low-flow stability, and only then assess the drainage capability retained under backup arrangements.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"先解單台交點，再解兩台交點並比較增加比例。將一台泵曲線稍微下移，說明均分流量假設為何不再成立，以及需要補量測哪個支路。","textEn":"Solve single- and two-pump intersections and compare the increase. Shift one pump curve downward slightly, explaining why equal sharing then fails and which branch measurements would be needed to determine the new distribution.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「並聯機組與共同管路機理與驗證」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Parallel pumps and common pipework mechanism and verification\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","設有一台備用泵就能保證抽水站任何單一故障都不減排水量。","以每台支路流量、共同揚程及轉速驗證分流，核對曲線使用的流量單位與機組組合。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","One spare pump guarantees unchanged station discharge under every single failure.","Verify sharing from individual branch flows, common head and speed, checking curve units and pump combinations."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以每台支路流量、共同揚程及轉速驗證分流，核對曲線使用的流量單位與機組組合。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Verify sharing from individual branch flows, common head and speed, checking curve units and pump combinations. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b270-v15-12","title":"並聯機組與共同管路機理與驗證：失效診斷","titleEn":"Parallel pumps and common pipework mechanism and verification: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「並聯機組與共同管路」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Parallel pumps and common pipework” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"直接把單台工況流量乘台數會忽略共同摩阻，異型泵也可能出現分流失衡；名義總容量足夠時，某台仍可能偏離允許運轉區而增加振動或過熱。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Multiplying a single-unit operating flow by unit count ignores shared friction, and dissimilar pumps may share unevenly. Even with adequate nominal total capacity, an individual unit can leave its acceptable range and experience vibration or overheating. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：以下兩台完全相同且均分流量，泵曲線與系統曲線均為教學二次式；沒有替代實機穩定區、效率及汽蝕檢查。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: This does not replace real-machine stability, efficiency or cavitation checks.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「兩台並聯泵的實際排水量必定是單台接原管路時的兩倍。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Two parallel pumps always deliver twice the single-pump flow through the original system.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"直接把單台工況流量乘台數會忽略共同摩阻，異型泵也可能出現分流失衡；名義總容量足夠時，某台仍可能偏離允許運轉區而增加振動或過熱。","textEn":"Multiplying a single-unit operating flow by unit count ignores shared friction, and dissimilar pumps may share unevenly. Even with adequate nominal total capacity, an individual unit can leave its acceptable range and experience vibration or overheating.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「並聯機組與共同管路機理與驗證」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Parallel pumps and common pipework mechanism and verification\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["直接把單台工況流量乘台數會忽略共同摩阻，異型泵也可能出現分流失衡；名義總容量足夠時，某台仍可能偏離允許運轉區而增加振動或過熱。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","水力功率就是抽水站電表功率，不必計入馬達和泵的損失。"],"optionsEn":["Multiplying a single-unit operating flow by unit count ignores shared friction, and dissimilar pumps may share unevenly.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Hydraulic power equals metered station power without pump or motor losses."],"answer":0,"explanation":"直接把單台工況流量乘台數會忽略共同摩阻，異型泵也可能出現分流失衡；名義總容量足夠時，某台仍可能偏離允許運轉區而增加振動或過熱。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Multiplying a single-unit operating flow by unit count ignores shared friction, and dissimilar pumps may share unevenly. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b270-v15-13","title":"電功率與效率鏈機理與驗證：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Electrical power and efficiency chain mechanism and verification: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-12"],"objective":"說明「電功率與效率鏈」如何影響防洪抽水站機組整合的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Electrical power and efficiency chain” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Flood-pumping-station integration”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"抽水的水力功率由流量和總揚程決定，馬達輸入還須考慮泵、傳動與電機效率。不同效率應對應各自能量邊界，不能重複扣同一損失；峰值功率、啟動需求與整場耗電又是不同問題，平均節能指標不足以代表防洪事件中的供電能力。本例泵與馬達效率分開且忽略其他輔機，計算穩態實功率；不包含啟動電流、功率因數或發電機瞬態容量。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「電功率與效率鏈」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Hydraulic power follows flow and total head, while motor input includes pump, transmission and electrical efficiencies. Each efficiency must correspond to a distinct energy boundary so losses are not counted twice. Peak power, starting demand and event energy are separate questions; a mean energy metric does not establish electrical adequacy during a flood. Pump and motor efficiencies are separate and auxiliary loads are excluded. The result is steady real power, not starting current, power factor or generator transient capacity. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Electrical power and efficiency chain” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設ρ=1000 kg/m³、Q=4 m³/s、H=6 m、ηp=0.75、ηm=0.95，P=ρgQH/(ηpηm)=330.44 kW，g=9.81 m/s²。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume ρ=1000 kg/m³, Q=4 m³/s, H=6 m, ηp=0.75, ηm=0.95 and g=9.81 m/s².","failure":"常見誤解：「水力功率就是抽水站電表功率，不必計入馬達和泵的損失。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Hydraulic power equals metered station power without pump or motor losses.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「電功率與效率鏈」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Electrical power and efficiency chain”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-13-k1","title":"電功率與效率鏈機理與驗證","titleEn":"Electrical power and efficiency chain mechanism and verification","text":"抽水的水力功率由流量和總揚程決定，馬達輸入還須考慮泵、傳動與電機效率。不同效率應對應各自能量邊界，不能重複扣同一損失；峰值功率、啟動需求與整場耗電又是不同問題，平均節能指標不足以代表防洪事件中的供電能力。","textEn":"Hydraulic power follows flow and total head, while motor input includes pump, transmission and electrical efficiencies. Each efficiency must correspond to a distinct energy boundary so losses are not counted twice.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：水力功率就是抽水站電表功率，不必計入馬達和泵的損失。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Hydraulic power equals metered station power without pump or motor losses. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「電功率與效率鏈機理與驗證」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Electrical power and efficiency chain mechanism and verification\" is correct?","options":["水力功率就是抽水站電表功率，不必計入馬達和泵的損失。","抽水的水力功率由流量和總揚程決定，馬達輸入還須考慮泵、傳動與電機效率。","泵降速一成，整站一定同時少抽一成水且省下固定立方比例電力。"],"optionsEn":["Hydraulic power equals metered station power without pump or motor losses.","Hydraulic power follows flow and total head, while motor input includes pump, transmission and electrical efficiencies.","Reducing speed ten percent guarantees ten percent less station flow and fixed cube-law energy savings."],"answer":1,"explanation":"抽水的水力功率由流量和總揚程決定，馬達輸入還須考慮泵、傳動與電機效率。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Hydraulic power follows flow and total head, while motor input includes pump, transmission and electrical efficiencies. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b270-v15-14","title":"電功率與效率鏈機理與驗證：定量估算","titleEn":"Electrical power and efficiency chain mechanism and verification: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「電功率與效率鏈」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Electrical power and efficiency chain” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設ρ=1000 kg/m³、Q=4 m³/s、H=6 m、ηp=0.75、ηm=0.95，P=ρgQH/(ηpηm)=330.44 kW，g=9.81 m/s²。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume ρ=1000 kg/m³, Q=4 m³/s, H=6 m, ηp=0.75, ηm=0.95 and g=9.81 m/s². Input P=ρgQH/(ηpηm)=330.44 kW. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：同步量測流量、揚程與電表實功率，核對效率曲線是否對應當時轉速和負載。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure flow, head and real electrical power synchronously, checking efficiency curves against actual speed and load.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設ρ=1000 kg/m³、Q=4 m³/s、H=6 m、ηp=0.75、ηm=0.95，P=ρgQH/(ηpηm)=330.44 kW，g=9.81 m/s²。","textEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume ρ=1000 kg/m³, Q=4 m³/s, H=6 m, ηp=0.75, ηm=0.95 and g=9.81 m/s². Input P=ρgQH/(ηpηm)=330.44 kW.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「電功率與效率鏈機理與驗證」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Electrical power and efficiency chain mechanism and verification\", which statement holds?","options":["池水位只要夠高，任何機組組合都不可能出現渦流或汽蝕。","閘門兩側淨水壓只需把水位差平方，與各側實際水深無關。","原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設ρ=1000 kg/m³、Q=4 m³/s、H=6 m、ηp=0.75、ηm=0.95，P=ρgQH/(ηpηm)=330.44 kW，g=9.81 m/s²。"],"optionsEn":["Sufficient sump level makes vortices or cavitation impossible for every pump combination.","Net gate pressure depends only on squared level difference, not the individual water depths.","Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume ρ=1000 kg/m³, Q=4 m³/s, H=6 m, ηp=0.75, ηm=0.95 and g=9.81 m/s²."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設ρ=1000 kg/m³、Q=4 m³/s、H=6 m、ηp=0.75、ηm=0.95，P=ρgQH/(ηpηm)=330.44 kW，g=9.81 m/s²。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume ρ=1000 kg/m³, Q=4 m³/s, H=6 m, ηp=0.75, ηm=0.95 and g=9.81 m/s². Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b270-v15-15","title":"電功率與效率鏈機理與驗證：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Electrical power and efficiency chain mechanism and verification: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「電功率與效率鏈」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Electrical power and efficiency chain” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"同步量測流量、揚程與電表實功率，核對效率曲線是否對應當時轉速和負載。將輔機與馬達邊界分開，另記錄啟動電壓和電流，避免以穩態功率測試代替啟動能力驗證。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure flow, head and real electrical power synchronously, checking efficiency curves against actual speed and load. Separate auxiliaries from motor boundaries and record starting voltage and current independently so that a steady-power test is not mistaken for validation of starting capability. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：畫出電表、馬達軸與水流三個能量邊界，將效率放在正確位置。比較泵效率下降而其他條件固定時的輸入功率，再指出啟動分析尚缺的電氣資料。","observationEn":"Site practice: Draw meter, motor-shaft and water-flow energy boundaries with efficiencies at the correct interfaces. Compare input power after reduced pump efficiency at fixed conditions, then identify electrical information still missing for a starting analysis.","failure":"注意干擾：把泵效率當成整體效率會低估供電需求，使用額定高效率代替偏離工況的效率也會造成偏差；只看平均千瓦可能忽略啟動壓降使其他機組掉電。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Using pump efficiency as overall efficiency understates electrical demand, and rated efficiency can misrepresent off-design operation. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"同步量測流量、揚程與電表實功率，核對效率曲線是否對應當時轉速和負載。將輔機與馬達邊界分開，另記錄啟動電壓和電流，避免以穩態功率測試代替啟動能力驗證。","textEn":"Measure flow, head and real electrical power synchronously, checking efficiency curves against actual speed and load. Separate auxiliaries from motor boundaries and record starting voltage and current independently so that a steady-power test is not mistaken for validation of starting capability.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"畫出電表、馬達軸與水流三個能量邊界，將效率放在正確位置。比較泵效率下降而其他條件固定時的輸入功率，再指出啟動分析尚缺的電氣資料。","textEn":"Draw meter, motor-shaft and water-flow energy boundaries with efficiencies at the correct interfaces. Compare input power after reduced pump efficiency at fixed conditions, then identify electrical information still missing for a starting analysis.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「電功率與效率鏈機理與驗證」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Electrical power and efficiency chain mechanism and verification\"?","options":["同步量測流量、揚程與電表實功率，核對效率曲線是否對應當時轉速和負載。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","泵的標示總流量大於平均雨水流量，就能保證任何洪水不積水。"],"optionsEn":["Measure flow, head and real electrical power synchronously, checking efficiency curves against actual speed and load.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Total labeled pump flow above mean runoff guarantees no flooding in any event."],"answer":0,"explanation":"同步量測流量、揚程與電表實功率，核對效率曲線是否對應當時轉速和負載。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure flow, head and real electrical power synchronously, checking efficiency curves against actual speed and load. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b270-v15-16","title":"電功率與效率鏈機理與驗證：失效診斷","titleEn":"Electrical power and efficiency chain mechanism and verification: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「電功率與效率鏈」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Electrical power and efficiency chain” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把泵效率當成整體效率會低估供電需求，使用額定高效率代替偏離工況的效率也會造成偏差；只看平均千瓦可能忽略啟動壓降使其他機組掉電。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Using pump efficiency as overall efficiency understates electrical demand, and rated efficiency can misrepresent off-design operation. Average kilowatts can also conceal a starting voltage dip that disconnects other operating units. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：本例泵與馬達效率分開且忽略其他輔機，計算穩態實功率；不包含啟動電流、功率因數或發電機瞬態容量。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The result is steady real power, not starting current, power factor or generator transient capacity.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「水力功率就是抽水站電表功率，不必計入馬達和泵的損失。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Hydraulic power equals metered station power without pump or motor losses.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把泵效率當成整體效率會低估供電需求，使用額定高效率代替偏離工況的效率也會造成偏差；只看平均千瓦可能忽略啟動壓降使其他機組掉電。","textEn":"Using pump efficiency as overall efficiency understates electrical demand, and rated efficiency can misrepresent off-design operation. Average kilowatts can also conceal a starting voltage dip that disconnects other operating units.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「電功率與效率鏈機理與驗證」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Electrical power and efficiency chain mechanism and verification\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","把泵效率當成整體效率會低估供電需求，使用額定高效率代替偏離工況的效率也會造成偏差；只看平均千瓦可能忽略啟動壓降使其他機組掉電。","泵降速一成，整站一定同時少抽一成水且省下固定立方比例電力。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Using pump efficiency as overall efficiency understates electrical demand, and rated efficiency can misrepresent off-design operation.","Reducing speed ten percent guarantees ten percent less station flow and fixed cube-law energy savings."],"answer":1,"explanation":"把泵效率當成整體效率會低估供電需求，使用額定高效率代替偏離工況的效率也會造成偏差；只看平均千瓦可能忽略啟動壓降使其他機組掉電。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using pump efficiency as overall efficiency understates electrical demand, and rated efficiency can misrepresent off-design operation. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b270-v15-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「變速相似與實際工況機理與驗證」與「啟停水位差與循環機理與驗證」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Speed affinity and operating conditions mechanism and verification\" and \"Level hysteresis and cycling mechanism and verification\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b270-v15-17","title":"變速相似與實際工況機理與驗證：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Speed affinity and operating conditions mechanism and verification: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-16"],"objective":"說明「變速相似與實際工況」如何影響防洪抽水站機組整合的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Speed affinity and operating conditions” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Flood-pumping-station integration”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"幾何相同的泵在相似工況下，流量、揚程和軸功率可依轉速比例建立近似關係，適合檢查性能曲線變化。實際站的靜揚程不隨轉速縮放，因此新工作點未必位於相似點；效率、汽蝕與低速穩定區也可能改變，不能把轉速平方或立方律直接當成整站保證。本例假設同一葉輪與近似相同效率，僅比較相似點；實際抽排量必須再與未同比縮放的系統曲線求交。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「變速相似與實際工況」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"For a geometrically unchanged pump at homologous conditions, flow, head and shaft power approximately scale with speed, supporting a curve-shift check. Station static head does not scale with speed, so the new operating point need not be homologous. Efficiency, cavitation and low-speed stability may change, preventing direct use of square or cube laws as station-wide guarantees. The example assumes one impeller and approximately unchanged efficiency and compares homologous points only. Actual discharge requires intersecting the shifted pump curve with the system curve. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Speed affinity and operating conditions” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設轉速比N2/N1=0.90，相似點Q2/Q1=0.90、H2/H1=0.81、P2/P1=0.729。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume speed ratio N2/N1=0.90.","failure":"常見誤解：「泵降速一成，整站一定同時少抽一成水且省下固定立方比例電力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Reducing speed ten percent guarantees ten percent less station flow and fixed cube-law energy savings.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「變速相似與實際工況」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Speed affinity and operating conditions”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-17-k1","title":"變速相似與實際工況機理與驗證","titleEn":"Speed affinity and operating conditions mechanism and verification","text":"幾何相同的泵在相似工況下，流量、揚程和軸功率可依轉速比例建立近似關係，適合檢查性能曲線變化。實際站的靜揚程不隨轉速縮放，因此新工作點未必位於相似點；效率、汽蝕與低速穩定區也可能改變，不能把轉速平方或立方律直接當成整站保證。","textEn":"For a geometrically unchanged pump at homologous conditions, flow, head and shaft power approximately scale with speed, supporting a curve-shift check. Station static head does not scale with speed, so the new operating point need not be homologous.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：泵降速一成，整站一定同時少抽一成水且省下固定立方比例電力。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Reducing speed ten percent guarantees ten percent less station flow and fixed cube-law energy savings. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「變速相似與實際工況機理與驗證」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Speed affinity and operating conditions mechanism and verification\" is correct?","options":["泵降速一成，整站一定同時少抽一成水且省下固定立方比例電力。","啟停週期等於調節容積除以泵流量，入流大小完全無關。","幾何相同的泵在相似工況下，流量、揚程和軸功率可依轉速比例建立近似關係，適合檢查性能曲線變化。"],"optionsEn":["Reducing speed ten percent guarantees ten percent less station flow and fixed cube-law energy savings.","The start-stop cycle equals regulating volume divided by pump flow and is independent of inflow.","For a geometrically unchanged pump at homologous conditions, flow, head and shaft power approximately scale with speed, supporting a curve-shift check."],"answer":2,"explanation":"幾何相同的泵在相似工況下，流量、揚程和軸功率可依轉速比例建立近似關係，適合檢查性能曲線變化。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"For a geometrically unchanged pump at homologous conditions, flow, head and shaft power approximately scale with speed, supporting a curve-shift check. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b270-v15-18","title":"變速相似與實際工況機理與驗證：定量估算","titleEn":"Speed affinity and operating conditions mechanism and verification: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「變速相似與實際工況」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Speed affinity and operating conditions” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設轉速比N2/N1=0.90，相似點Q2/Q1=0.90、H2/H1=0.81、P2/P1=0.729。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume speed ratio N2/N1=0.90. At homologous points Q2/Q1=0.90, H2/H1=0.81 and P2/P1=0.729. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：將原泵曲線按相似律移動後與實際系統曲線重求交點，核對效率、允許轉速和汽蝕資料。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Shift the pump curve using affinity laws and solve its intersection with the actual system curve, checking efficiency, allowed speed and cavitation data.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設轉速比N2/N1=0.90，相似點Q2/Q1=0.90、H2/H1=0.81、P2/P1=0.729。","textEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume speed ratio N2/N1=0.90. At homologous points Q2/Q1=0.90, H2/H1=0.81 and P2/P1=0.729.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「變速相似與實際工況機理與驗證」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Speed affinity and operating conditions mechanism and verification\", which statement holds?","options":["原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設轉速比N2/N1=0.90，相似點Q2/Q1=0.90、H2/H1=0.81、P2/P1=0.729。","備援電源連續千瓦足夠，就代表所有泵可以同時順利啟動。","設有一台備用泵就能保證抽水站任何單一故障都不減排水量。"],"optionsEn":["Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume speed ratio N2/N1=0.90.","Adequate continuous backup kilowatts guarantee that all pumps can start simultaneously.","One spare pump guarantees unchanged station discharge under every single failure."],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設轉速比N2/N1=0.90，相似點Q2/Q1=0.90、H2/H1=0.81、P2/P1=0.729。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume speed ratio N2/N1=0.90. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b270-v15-19","title":"變速相似與實際工況機理與驗證：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Speed affinity and operating conditions mechanism and verification: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「變速相似與實際工況」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Speed affinity and operating conditions” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"將原泵曲線按相似律移動後與實際系統曲線重求交點，核對效率、允許轉速和汽蝕資料。用現地量測驗證結果，尤其檢查靜揚程占比高時是否仍能維持有效出流。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Shift the pump curve using affinity laws and solve its intersection with the actual system curve, checking efficiency, allowed speed and cavitation data. Validate with field observations, especially whether useful discharge remains when static head forms a large share of total head. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：畫出含靜揚程與不含靜揚程兩條系統曲線，比較同一降速泵曲線的交點。指出相似點與實際工作點的差別，避免把兩種比例放在同一張效益表。","observationEn":"Site practice: Draw system curves with and without static head and compare intersections with one reduced-speed pump curve. Distinguish homologous points from operating points so their ratios are not mixed in a performance table.","failure":"注意干擾：直接宣稱降速一成必節電百分之二十七點一，會忽略新工作點和效率改變；靜揚程較大時，低速泵可能無法克服外水位而幾乎沒有抽排。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Claiming a guaranteed 27.1-percent saving from a ten-percent speed reduction ignores the changed operating point and efficiency. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"將原泵曲線按相似律移動後與實際系統曲線重求交點，核對效率、允許轉速和汽蝕資料。用現地量測驗證結果，尤其檢查靜揚程占比高時是否仍能維持有效出流。","textEn":"Shift the pump curve using affinity laws and solve its intersection with the actual system curve, checking efficiency, allowed speed and cavitation data. Validate with field observations, especially whether useful discharge remains when static head forms a large share of total head.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"畫出含靜揚程與不含靜揚程兩條系統曲線，比較同一降速泵曲線的交點。指出相似點與實際工作點的差別，避免把兩種比例放在同一張效益表。","textEn":"Draw system curves with and without static head and compare intersections with one reduced-speed pump curve. Distinguish homologous points from operating points so their ratios are not mixed in a performance table.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「變速相似與實際工況機理與驗證」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Speed affinity and operating conditions mechanism and verification\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","將原泵曲線按相似律移動後與實際系統曲線重求交點，核對效率、允許轉速和汽蝕資料。","防洪泵在所有外河水位下都會維持同一銘牌流量。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Shift the pump curve using affinity laws and solve its intersection with the actual system curve, checking efficiency, allowed speed and cavitation data.","A flood pump maintains the same nameplate flow at every receiving-river level."],"answer":1,"explanation":"將原泵曲線按相似律移動後與實際系統曲線重求交點，核對效率、允許轉速和汽蝕資料。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Shift the pump curve using affinity laws and solve its intersection with the actual system curve, checking efficiency, allowed speed and cavitation data. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b270-v15-20","title":"變速相似與實際工況機理與驗證：失效診斷","titleEn":"Speed affinity and operating conditions mechanism and verification: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「變速相似與實際工況」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Speed affinity and operating conditions” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"直接宣稱降速一成必節電百分之二十七點一，會忽略新工作點和效率改變；靜揚程較大時，低速泵可能無法克服外水位而幾乎沒有抽排。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Claiming a guaranteed 27.1-percent saving from a ten-percent speed reduction ignores the changed operating point and efficiency. With substantial static head, a slower pump may barely overcome receiving water and provide little drainage. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：本例假設同一葉輪與近似相同效率，僅比較相似點；實際抽排量必須再與未同比縮放的系統曲線求交。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Actual discharge requires intersecting the shifted pump curve with the system curve.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「泵降速一成，整站一定同時少抽一成水且省下固定立方比例電力。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Reducing speed ten percent guarantees ten percent less station flow and fixed cube-law energy savings.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"直接宣稱降速一成必節電百分之二十七點一，會忽略新工作點和效率改變；靜揚程較大時，低速泵可能無法克服外水位而幾乎沒有抽排。","textEn":"Claiming a guaranteed 27.1-percent saving from a ten-percent speed reduction ignores the changed operating point and efficiency. With substantial static head, a slower pump may barely overcome receiving water and provide little drainage.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「變速相似與實際工況機理與驗證」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Speed affinity and operating conditions mechanism and verification\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","啟停週期等於調節容積除以泵流量，入流大小完全無關。","直接宣稱降速一成必節電百分之二十七點一，會忽略新工作點和效率改變；靜揚程較大時，低速泵可能無法克服外水位而幾乎沒有抽排。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","The start-stop cycle equals regulating volume divided by pump flow and is independent of inflow.","Claiming a guaranteed 27.1-percent saving from a ten-percent speed reduction ignores the changed operating point and efficiency."],"answer":2,"explanation":"直接宣稱降速一成必節電百分之二十七點一，會忽略新工作點和效率改變；靜揚程較大時，低速泵可能無法克服外水位而幾乎沒有抽排。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Claiming a guaranteed 27.1-percent saving from a ten-percent speed reduction ignores the changed operating point and efficiency. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b270-v15-21","title":"啟停水位差與循環機理與驗證：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Level hysteresis and cycling mechanism and verification: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-20"],"objective":"說明「啟停水位差與循環」如何影響防洪抽水站機組整合的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Level hysteresis and cycling” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Flood-pumping-station integration”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"單台泵的啟停水位差形成可用調節容積，能減少頻繁啟動，但過大水位帶可能占用防洪儲量或降低淹沒裕度。填充與抽降時間分別受入流及淨抽出量控制，不可只用池容積除以泵流量；多台輪替、變入流與感測遲延會讓實際循環更複雜。本例為一台泵、固定池面積與固定入流，且抽排大於入流；算得啟動頻率只是比較，不是設備允許值或現場設定。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「啟停水位差與循環」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The start-stop level band creates regulating volume that can reduce repeated starts, but an excessive band may consume flood storage or reduce submergence margin. Filling and drawdown depend on inflow and net pumping respectively, not simply volume divided by pump flow. Multiple-unit rotation, variable inflow and sensing delay further complicate actual cycling. The example uses one pump, constant area and inflow, with pumping exceeding inflow. Its start frequency is a comparison, not an equipment limit or field setting. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Level hysteresis and cycling” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設A=100 m²、啟停差Δh=0.60 m、Qi=0.50、Qp=2.0 m³/s；循環T=60/0.50+60/(2−0.50)=160 s，即22.5次/h。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume A=100 m², level band Δh=0.60 m, Qi=0.50 and Qp=2.0 m³/s.","failure":"常見誤解：「啟停週期等於調節容積除以泵流量，入流大小完全無關。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The start-stop cycle equals regulating volume divided by pump flow and is independent of inflow.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「啟停水位差與循環」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Level hysteresis and cycling”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-21-k1","title":"啟停水位差與循環機理與驗證","titleEn":"Level hysteresis and cycling mechanism and verification","text":"單台泵的啟停水位差形成可用調節容積，能減少頻繁啟動，但過大水位帶可能占用防洪儲量或降低淹沒裕度。填充與抽降時間分別受入流及淨抽出量控制，不可只用池容積除以泵流量；多台輪替、變入流與感測遲延會讓實際循環更複雜。","textEn":"The start-stop level band creates regulating volume that can reduce repeated starts, but an excessive band may consume flood storage or reduce submergence margin. Filling and drawdown depend on inflow and net pumping respectively, not simply volume divided by pump flow.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：啟停週期等於調節容積除以泵流量，入流大小完全無關。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The start-stop cycle equals regulating volume divided by pump flow and is independent of inflow. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「啟停水位差與循環機理與驗證」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Level hysteresis and cycling mechanism and verification\" is correct?","options":["單台泵的啟停水位差形成可用調節容積，能減少頻繁啟動，但過大水位帶可能占用防洪儲量或降低淹沒裕度。","啟停週期等於調節容積除以泵流量，入流大小完全無關。","池水位只要夠高，任何機組組合都不可能出現渦流或汽蝕。"],"optionsEn":["The start-stop level band creates regulating volume that can reduce repeated starts, but an excessive band may consume flood storage or reduce submergence margin.","The start-stop cycle equals regulating volume divided by pump flow and is independent of inflow.","Sufficient sump level makes vortices or cavitation impossible for every pump combination."],"answer":0,"explanation":"單台泵的啟停水位差形成可用調節容積，能減少頻繁啟動，但過大水位帶可能占用防洪儲量或降低淹沒裕度。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The start-stop level band creates regulating volume that can reduce repeated starts, but an excessive band may consume flood storage or reduce submergence margin. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b270-v15-22","title":"啟停水位差與循環機理與驗證：定量估算","titleEn":"Level hysteresis and cycling mechanism and verification: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「啟停水位差與循環」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Level hysteresis and cycling” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設A=100 m²、啟停差Δh=0.60 m、Qi=0.50、Qp=2.0 m³/s；循環T=60/0.50+60/(2−0.50)=160 s，即22.5次/h。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume A=100 m², level band Δh=0.60 m, Qi=0.50 and Qp=2.0 m³/s. Cycle T=60/0.50+60/(2−0.50)=160 s, or 22.5 starts/h. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：用事件紀錄核對啟動、停止、入流及池水位，檢查每次實際抽降時間與計算差異。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check starts, stops, inflow and sump level against event logs, comparing actual and calculated drawdown time.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設A=100 m²、啟停差Δh=0.60 m、Qi=0.50、Qp=2.0 m³/s；循環T=60/0.50+60/(2−0.50)=160 s，即22.5次/h。","textEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume A=100 m², level band Δh=0.60 m, Qi=0.50 and Qp=2.0 m³/s. Cycle T=60/0.50+60/(2−0.50)=160 s, or 22.5 starts/h.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「啟停水位差與循環機理與驗證」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Level hysteresis and cycling mechanism and verification\", which statement holds?","options":["閘門兩側淨水壓只需把水位差平方，與各側實際水深無關。","原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設A=100 m²、啟停差Δh=0.60 m、Qi=0.50、Qp=2.0 m³/s。","泵的標示總流量大於平均雨水流量，就能保證任何洪水不積水。"],"optionsEn":["Net gate pressure depends only on squared level difference, not the individual water depths.","Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume A=100 m², level band Δh=0.60 m, Qi=0.50 and Qp=2.0 m³/s.","Total labeled pump flow above mean runoff guarantees no flooding in any event."],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設A=100 m²、啟停差Δh=0.60 m、Qi=0.50、Qp=2.0 m³/s；循環T=60/0.50+60/(2−0.50)=160 s，即22.5次/h。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume A=100 m², level band Δh=0.60 m, Qi=0.50 and Qp=2.0 m³/s. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b270-v15-23","title":"啟停水位差與循環機理與驗證：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Level hysteresis and cycling mechanism and verification: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「啟停水位差與循環」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Level hysteresis and cycling” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"用事件紀錄核對啟動、停止、入流及池水位，檢查每次實際抽降時間與計算差異。將設備可允許啟動次數、最小運轉時間及池體淹沒條件一起核對，避免只靠一條水位帶決策。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check starts, stops, inflow and sump level against event logs, comparing actual and calculated drawdown time. Review permitted starts, minimum run time and submergence together rather than deciding from the level band alone, and record any delayed switching behavior. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：分開計算填充與抽降時間，再把入流改成原值兩倍觀察循環變化。將水位帶、可用防洪儲量和最低淹沒畫在同一剖面，說明三者的限制關係。","observationEn":"Site practice: Calculate fill and drawdown times separately, then double inflow and examine the cycle change. Show the level band, available flood storage and minimum submergence on one section, explaining how their constraints interact.","failure":"注意干擾：漏掉持續入流會低估抽降時間，水位噪訊可能使接點反覆切換；為減少啟動而任意擴大水位帶，則可能犧牲暴雨時原本可用的儲水空間。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Ignoring continuing inflow understates drawdown time, and level noise can chatter the switching signal. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用事件紀錄核對啟動、停止、入流及池水位，檢查每次實際抽降時間與計算差異。將設備可允許啟動次數、最小運轉時間及池體淹沒條件一起核對，避免只靠一條水位帶決策。","textEn":"Check starts, stops, inflow and sump level against event logs, comparing actual and calculated drawdown time. Review permitted starts, minimum run time and submergence together rather than deciding from the level band alone, and record any delayed switching behavior.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"分開計算填充與抽降時間，再把入流改成原值兩倍觀察循環變化。將水位帶、可用防洪儲量和最低淹沒畫在同一剖面，說明三者的限制關係。","textEn":"Calculate fill and drawdown times separately, then double inflow and examine the cycle change. Show the level band, available flood storage and minimum submergence on one section, explaining how their constraints interact.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「啟停水位差與循環機理與驗證」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Level hysteresis and cycling mechanism and verification\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","兩台並聯泵的實際排水量必定是單台接原管路時的兩倍。","用事件紀錄核對啟動、停止、入流及池水位，檢查每次實際抽降時間與計算差異。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","Two parallel pumps always deliver twice the single-pump flow through the original system.","Check starts, stops, inflow and sump level against event logs, comparing actual and calculated drawdown time."],"answer":2,"explanation":"用事件紀錄核對啟動、停止、入流及池水位，檢查每次實際抽降時間與計算差異。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check starts, stops, inflow and sump level against event logs, comparing actual and calculated drawdown time. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b270-v15-24","title":"啟停水位差與循環機理與驗證：失效診斷","titleEn":"Level hysteresis and cycling mechanism and verification: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「啟停水位差與循環」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Level hysteresis and cycling” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"漏掉持續入流會低估抽降時間，水位噪訊可能使接點反覆切換；為減少啟動而任意擴大水位帶，則可能犧牲暴雨時原本可用的儲水空間。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Ignoring continuing inflow understates drawdown time, and level noise can chatter the switching signal. Enlarging the band solely to reduce starts may consume storage that would otherwise be available during heavy rainfall. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：本例為一台泵、固定池面積與固定入流，且抽排大於入流；算得啟動頻率只是比較，不是設備允許值或現場設定。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Its start frequency is a comparison, not an equipment limit or field setting.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「啟停週期等於調節容積除以泵流量，入流大小完全無關。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The start-stop cycle equals regulating volume divided by pump flow and is independent of inflow.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"漏掉持續入流會低估抽降時間，水位噪訊可能使接點反覆切換；為減少啟動而任意擴大水位帶，則可能犧牲暴雨時原本可用的儲水空間。","textEn":"Ignoring continuing inflow understates drawdown time, and level noise can chatter the switching signal. Enlarging the band solely to reduce starts may consume storage that would otherwise be available during heavy rainfall.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「啟停水位差與循環機理與驗證」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Level hysteresis and cycling mechanism and verification\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["漏掉持續入流會低估抽降時間，水位噪訊可能使接點反覆切換；為減少啟動而任意擴大水位帶，則可能犧牲暴雨時原本可用的儲水空間。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","池水位只要夠高，任何機組組合都不可能出現渦流或汽蝕。"],"optionsEn":["Ignoring continuing inflow understates drawdown time, and level noise can chatter the switching signal.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","Sufficient sump level makes vortices or cavitation impossible for every pump combination."],"answer":0,"explanation":"漏掉持續入流會低估抽降時間，水位噪訊可能使接點反覆切換；為減少啟動而任意擴大水位帶，則可能犧牲暴雨時原本可用的儲水空間。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Ignoring continuing inflow understates drawdown time, and level noise can chatter the switching signal. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b270-v15-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「吸入工況與流場品質機理與驗證」與「實功率視在功率與備援機理與驗證」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Suction conditions and flow quality mechanism and verification\" and \"Real apparent and backup power mechanism and verification\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b270-v15-25","title":"吸入工況與流場品質機理與驗證：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Suction conditions and flow quality mechanism and verification: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-24"],"objective":"說明「吸入工況與流場品質」如何影響防洪抽水站機組整合的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Suction conditions and flow quality” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Flood-pumping-station integration”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"抽水站入口須同時滿足壓力裕度與均勻流場，池水位足夠也可能因不對稱入流而產生渦流與捲氣。淨正吸入水頭取決於大氣壓、吸入水位、蒸氣壓及損失，設備需求又隨流量和轉速變動；整合多台機組時應檢查不同組合造成的流場，不能只驗證全開狀態。下式各項均以同一淡水密度的水頭表示，水面高於泵參考取正；正差值不保證沒有渦流、捲氣或其他吸入問題。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「吸入工況與流場品質」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Pump inlets need both pressure margin and acceptable flow quality; adequate depth can still coexist with vortices from asymmetric inflow. Available NPSH depends on atmospheric pressure, sump level, vapor pressure and losses, while required NPSH varies with flow and speed. Integrating several units requires checking different combinations rather than testing only all-units-on operation. All terms are freshwater heads on one density basis, with surface above the pump reference positive. A positive margin does not guarantee absence of vortices, air entrainment or other inlet problems. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Suction conditions and flow quality” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設大氣水頭10.3 m、靜淹水1.5 m、蒸氣壓水頭0.25 m、吸入損失1.2 m，NPSHa=10.35 m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume atmospheric head 10.3 m, static submergence 1.5 m, vapor head 0.25 m and suction loss 1.2 m.","failure":"常見誤解：「池水位只要夠高，任何機組組合都不可能出現渦流或汽蝕。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Sufficient sump level makes vortices or cavitation impossible for every pump combination.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「吸入工況與流場品質」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Suction conditions and flow quality”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-25-k1","title":"吸入工況與流場品質機理與驗證","titleEn":"Suction conditions and flow quality mechanism and verification","text":"抽水站入口須同時滿足壓力裕度與均勻流場，池水位足夠也可能因不對稱入流而產生渦流與捲氣。淨正吸入水頭取決於大氣壓、吸入水位、蒸氣壓及損失，設備需求又隨流量和轉速變動；整合多台機組時應檢查不同組合造成的流場，不能只驗證全開狀態。","textEn":"Pump inlets need both pressure margin and acceptable flow quality; adequate depth can still coexist with vortices from asymmetric inflow. Available NPSH depends on atmospheric pressure, sump level, vapor pressure and losses, while required NPSH varies with flow and speed.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：池水位只要夠高，任何機組組合都不可能出現渦流或汽蝕。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Sufficient sump level makes vortices or cavitation impossible for every pump combination. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「吸入工況與流場品質機理與驗證」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Suction conditions and flow quality mechanism and verification\" is correct?","options":["池水位只要夠高，任何機組組合都不可能出現渦流或汽蝕。","抽水站入口須同時滿足壓力裕度與均勻流場，池水位足夠也可能因不對稱入流而產生渦流與捲氣。","備援電源連續千瓦足夠，就代表所有泵可以同時順利啟動。"],"optionsEn":["Sufficient sump level makes vortices or cavitation impossible for every pump combination.","Pump inlets need both pressure margin and acceptable flow quality; adequate depth can still coexist with vortices from asymmetric inflow.","Adequate continuous backup kilowatts guarantee that all pumps can start simultaneously."],"answer":1,"explanation":"抽水站入口須同時滿足壓力裕度與均勻流場，池水位足夠也可能因不對稱入流而產生渦流與捲氣。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Pump inlets need both pressure margin and acceptable flow quality; adequate depth can still coexist with vortices from asymmetric inflow. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b270-v15-26","title":"吸入工況與流場品質機理與驗證：定量估算","titleEn":"Suction conditions and flow quality mechanism and verification: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「吸入工況與流場品質」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Suction conditions and flow quality” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設大氣水頭10.3 m、靜淹水1.5 m、蒸氣壓水頭0.25 m、吸入損失1.2 m，NPSHa=10.35 m。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume atmospheric head 10.3 m, static submergence 1.5 m, vapor head 0.25 m and suction loss 1.2 m. Available NPSH is 10.35 m. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以低池水位、高水溫及代表機組組合檢查吸入壓力，核對泵參考高程與需求曲線。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check suction pressure at low sump level, high water temperature and representative unit combinations, verifying pump datum and required curves.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設大氣水頭10.3 m、靜淹水1.5 m、蒸氣壓水頭0.25 m、吸入損失1.2 m，NPSHa=10.35 m。","textEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume atmospheric head 10.3 m, static submergence 1.5 m, vapor head 0.25 m and suction loss 1.2 m. Available NPSH is 10.35 m.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「吸入工況與流場品質機理與驗證」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Suction conditions and flow quality mechanism and verification\", which statement holds?","options":["設有一台備用泵就能保證抽水站任何單一故障都不減排水量。","防洪泵在所有外河水位下都會維持同一銘牌流量。","原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設大氣水頭10.3 m、靜淹水1.5 m、蒸氣壓水頭0.25 m、吸入損失1.2 m，NPSHa=10.35 m。"],"optionsEn":["One spare pump guarantees unchanged station discharge under every single failure.","A flood pump maintains the same nameplate flow at every receiving-river level.","Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume atmospheric head 10.3 m, static submergence 1.5 m, vapor head 0.25 m and suction loss 1.2 m."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設大氣水頭10.3 m、靜淹水1.5 m、蒸氣壓水頭0.25 m、吸入損失1.2 m，NPSHa=10.35 m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume atmospheric head 10.3 m, static submergence 1.5 m, vapor head 0.25 m and suction loss 1.2 m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b270-v15-27","title":"吸入工況與流場品質機理與驗證：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Suction conditions and flow quality mechanism and verification: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「吸入工況與流場品質」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Suction conditions and flow quality” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以低池水位、高水溫及代表機組組合檢查吸入壓力，核對泵參考高程與需求曲線。另用速度分布、渦流觀察或適用模型驗證入口品質，將汽蝕壓力與捲氣問題分開判讀。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check suction pressure at low sump level, high water temperature and representative unit combinations, verifying pump datum and required curves. Independently examine velocity distribution and vortices through observations or suitable models, keeping cavitation-pressure and air-entrainment assessments distinct in the evidence. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：列出全開、單台與相鄰一台停用三種流場檢查，分別指出壓力與速度證據。計算一個增加入口損失的情境，說明同樣水位也會改變吸入裕度。","observationEn":"Site practice: List all-on, single-unit and adjacent-unit-out checks, distinguishing pressure from velocity evidence. Calculate a case with greater entrance loss and explain why identical sump level can still produce a different suction margin.","failure":"注意干擾：只以池水深推定無汽蝕會忽略入口損失與溫度，某些機組停用後也可能產生偏流；入口整流改善一種組合時，未必同時改善其他組合。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Inferring cavitation freedom from depth alone ignores entrance losses and temperature. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以低池水位、高水溫及代表機組組合檢查吸入壓力，核對泵參考高程與需求曲線。另用速度分布、渦流觀察或適用模型驗證入口品質，將汽蝕壓力與捲氣問題分開判讀。","textEn":"Check suction pressure at low sump level, high water temperature and representative unit combinations, verifying pump datum and required curves. Independently examine velocity distribution and vortices through observations or suitable models, keeping cavitation-pressure and air-entrainment assessments distinct in the evidence.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"列出全開、單台與相鄰一台停用三種流場檢查，分別指出壓力與速度證據。計算一個增加入口損失的情境，說明同樣水位也會改變吸入裕度。","textEn":"List all-on, single-unit and adjacent-unit-out checks, distinguishing pressure from velocity evidence. Calculate a case with greater entrance loss and explain why identical sump level can still produce a different suction margin.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「吸入工況與流場品質機理與驗證」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Suction conditions and flow quality mechanism and verification\"?","options":["以低池水位、高水溫及代表機組組合檢查吸入壓力，核對泵參考高程與需求曲線。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","水力功率就是抽水站電表功率，不必計入馬達和泵的損失。"],"optionsEn":["Check suction pressure at low sump level, high water temperature and representative unit combinations, verifying pump datum and required curves.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Hydraulic power equals metered station power without pump or motor losses."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以低池水位、高水溫及代表機組組合檢查吸入壓力，核對泵參考高程與需求曲線。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check suction pressure at low sump level, high water temperature and representative unit combinations, verifying pump datum and required curves. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b270-v15-28","title":"吸入工況與流場品質機理與驗證：失效診斷","titleEn":"Suction conditions and flow quality mechanism and verification: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「吸入工況與流場品質」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Suction conditions and flow quality” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"只以池水深推定無汽蝕會忽略入口損失與溫度，某些機組停用後也可能產生偏流；入口整流改善一種組合時，未必同時改善其他組合。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Inferring cavitation freedom from depth alone ignores entrance losses and temperature. Idle units can change approach symmetry, and an intake modification improving one combination may not improve all other operating combinations. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：下式各項均以同一淡水密度的水頭表示，水面高於泵參考取正；正差值不保證沒有渦流、捲氣或其他吸入問題。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: A positive margin does not guarantee absence of vortices, air entrainment or other inlet problems.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「池水位只要夠高，任何機組組合都不可能出現渦流或汽蝕。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Sufficient sump level makes vortices or cavitation impossible for every pump combination.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只以池水深推定無汽蝕會忽略入口損失與溫度，某些機組停用後也可能產生偏流；入口整流改善一種組合時，未必同時改善其他組合。","textEn":"Inferring cavitation freedom from depth alone ignores entrance losses and temperature. Idle units can change approach symmetry, and an intake modification improving one combination may not improve all other operating combinations.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「吸入工況與流場品質機理與驗證」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Suction conditions and flow quality mechanism and verification\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","只以池水深推定無汽蝕會忽略入口損失與溫度，某些機組停用後也可能產生偏流；入口整流改善一種組合時，未必同時改善其他組合。","備援電源連續千瓦足夠，就代表所有泵可以同時順利啟動。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Inferring cavitation freedom from depth alone ignores entrance losses and temperature.","Adequate continuous backup kilowatts guarantee that all pumps can start simultaneously."],"answer":1,"explanation":"只以池水深推定無汽蝕會忽略入口損失與溫度，某些機組停用後也可能產生偏流；入口整流改善一種組合時，未必同時改善其他組合。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Inferring cavitation freedom from depth alone ignores entrance losses and temperature. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b270-v15-29","title":"實功率視在功率與備援機理與驗證：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Real apparent and backup power mechanism and verification: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-28"],"objective":"說明「實功率視在功率與備援」如何影響防洪抽水站機組整合的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Real apparent and backup power” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Flood-pumping-station integration”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"備援電源須供應泵、控制和輔機，實功率與視在功率是不同容量約束，功率因數不能被效率取代。機組啟動時的電流與電壓暫降可能決定可行組合，即使連續千瓦需求足夠也不代表能順利啟動；燃料、冷卻及淹水隔離另影響可維持的事件時間。本例只換算平衡穩態負載的視在功率，不提供發電機選型容量；啟動、諧波及備援輔機需求尚未加入。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「實功率視在功率與備援」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Backup supply serves pumps, controls and auxiliaries. Real and apparent power impose different constraints, and power factor is not efficiency. Starting current and voltage dip can determine feasible combinations even when continuous kilowatts appear adequate. Fuel, cooling and flood isolation separately influence how long the station can continue through an event. The example converts a balanced steady load to apparent power only, not generator selection capacity. Starting, harmonics and backup auxiliary demand remain excluded. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Real apparent and backup power” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設穩態實功率P=500 kW、功率因數pf=0.80，視在功率S=P/pf=625 kVA。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume steady real power P=500 kW and power factor pf=0.80.","failure":"常見誤解：「備援電源連續千瓦足夠，就代表所有泵可以同時順利啟動。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Adequate continuous backup kilowatts guarantee that all pumps can start simultaneously.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「實功率視在功率與備援」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Real apparent and backup power”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-29-k1","title":"實功率視在功率與備援機理與驗證","titleEn":"Real apparent and backup power mechanism and verification","text":"備援電源須供應泵、控制和輔機，實功率與視在功率是不同容量約束，功率因數不能被效率取代。機組啟動時的電流與電壓暫降可能決定可行組合，即使連續千瓦需求足夠也不代表能順利啟動；燃料、冷卻及淹水隔離另影響可維持的事件時間。","textEn":"Backup supply serves pumps, controls and auxiliaries. Real and apparent power impose different constraints, and power factor is not efficiency.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：備援電源連續千瓦足夠，就代表所有泵可以同時順利啟動。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Adequate continuous backup kilowatts guarantee that all pumps can start simultaneously. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「實功率視在功率與備援機理與驗證」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Real apparent and backup power mechanism and verification\" is correct?","options":["備援電源連續千瓦足夠，就代表所有泵可以同時順利啟動。","閘門兩側淨水壓只需把水位差平方，與各側實際水深無關。","備援電源須供應泵、控制和輔機，實功率與視在功率是不同容量約束，功率因數不能被效率取代。"],"optionsEn":["Adequate continuous backup kilowatts guarantee that all pumps can start simultaneously.","Net gate pressure depends only on squared level difference, not the individual water depths.","Backup supply serves pumps, controls and auxiliaries."],"answer":2,"explanation":"備援電源須供應泵、控制和輔機，實功率與視在功率是不同容量約束，功率因數不能被效率取代。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Backup supply serves pumps, controls and auxiliaries. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b270-v15-30","title":"實功率視在功率與備援機理與驗證：定量估算","titleEn":"Real apparent and backup power mechanism and verification: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「實功率視在功率與備援」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Real apparent and backup power” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設穩態實功率P=500 kW、功率因數pf=0.80，視在功率S=P/pf=625 kVA。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume steady real power P=500 kW and power factor pf=0.80. Apparent power S=P/pf=625 kVA. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：建立機組與輔機負載表，分開持續千瓦、千伏安及啟動事件，核對供電邊界和保護配合。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Build a pump-and-auxiliary load list separating continuous kilowatts, kilovolt-amperes and starts, checking supply boundaries and protection coordination.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設穩態實功率P=500 kW、功率因數pf=0.80，視在功率S=P/pf=625 kVA。","textEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume steady real power P=500 kW and power factor pf=0.80. Apparent power S=P/pf=625 kVA.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「實功率視在功率與備援機理與驗證」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Real apparent and backup power mechanism and verification\", which statement holds?","options":["原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設穩態實功率P=500 kW、功率因數pf=0.80，視在功率S=P/pf=625 kVA。","泵的標示總流量大於平均雨水流量，就能保證任何洪水不積水。","兩台並聯泵的實際排水量必定是單台接原管路時的兩倍。"],"optionsEn":["Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume steady real power P=500 kW and power factor pf=0.80.","Total labeled pump flow above mean runoff guarantees no flooding in any event.","Two parallel pumps always deliver twice the single-pump flow through the original system."],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設穩態實功率P=500 kW、功率因數pf=0.80，視在功率S=P/pf=625 kVA。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume steady real power P=500 kW and power factor pf=0.80. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b270-v15-31","title":"實功率視在功率與備援機理與驗證：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Real apparent and backup power mechanism and verification: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「實功率視在功率與備援」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Real apparent and backup power” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"建立機組與輔機負載表，分開持續千瓦、千伏安及啟動事件，核對供電邊界和保護配合。以受控測試記錄電壓、頻率和恢復時間，另檢查燃料及冷卻不會受同一洪水中斷。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Build a pump-and-auxiliary load list separating continuous kilowatts, kilovolt-amperes and starts, checking supply boundaries and protection coordination. Record voltage, frequency and recovery in controlled tests, and independently verify that fuel and cooling are not interrupted by the same flood exposure. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：把三個假設負載分成持續與啟動兩張表，再計算同一實功率在不同功率因數下的視在功率。指出仍需電源動態資料才能判斷的啟動問題。","observationEn":"Site practice: Separate three hypothetical loads into continuous and starting tables, then compare apparent power at different power factors for the same real load. Identify starting questions that still require dynamic supply information rather than steady arithmetic.","failure":"注意干擾：把千瓦直接當千伏安會低估電氣容量，忽略啟動可能造成連鎖跳脫；備援發電機若與主配電共處易淹位置，也可能在需要時一起失效。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Equating kilowatts with kilovolt-amperes understates electrical capacity, and omitted starting demand can trigger cascading trips. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"建立機組與輔機負載表，分開持續千瓦、千伏安及啟動事件，核對供電邊界和保護配合。以受控測試記錄電壓、頻率和恢復時間，另檢查燃料及冷卻不會受同一洪水中斷。","textEn":"Build a pump-and-auxiliary load list separating continuous kilowatts, kilovolt-amperes and starts, checking supply boundaries and protection coordination. Record voltage, frequency and recovery in controlled tests, and independently verify that fuel and cooling are not interrupted by the same flood exposure.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"把三個假設負載分成持續與啟動兩張表，再計算同一實功率在不同功率因數下的視在功率。指出仍需電源動態資料才能判斷的啟動問題。","textEn":"Separate three hypothetical loads into continuous and starting tables, then compare apparent power at different power factors for the same real load. Identify starting questions that still require dynamic supply information rather than steady arithmetic.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「實功率視在功率與備援機理與驗證」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Real apparent and backup power mechanism and verification\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","建立機組與輔機負載表，分開持續千瓦、千伏安及啟動事件，核對供電邊界和保護配合。","泵降速一成，整站一定同時少抽一成水且省下固定立方比例電力。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Build a pump-and-auxiliary load list separating continuous kilowatts, kilovolt-amperes and starts, checking supply boundaries and protection coordination.","Reducing speed ten percent guarantees ten percent less station flow and fixed cube-law energy savings."],"answer":1,"explanation":"建立機組與輔機負載表，分開持續千瓦、千伏安及啟動事件，核對供電邊界和保護配合。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Build a pump-and-auxiliary load list separating continuous kilowatts, kilovolt-amperes and starts, checking supply boundaries and protection coordination. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b270-v15-32","title":"實功率視在功率與備援機理與驗證：失效診斷","titleEn":"Real apparent and backup power mechanism and verification: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「實功率視在功率與備援」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Real apparent and backup power” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把千瓦直接當千伏安會低估電氣容量，忽略啟動可能造成連鎖跳脫；備援發電機若與主配電共處易淹位置，也可能在需要時一起失效。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Equating kilowatts with kilovolt-amperes understates electrical capacity, and omitted starting demand can trigger cascading trips. A backup generator sharing a flood-prone location with main distribution can fail at the same time it is needed. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：本例只換算平衡穩態負載的視在功率，不提供發電機選型容量；啟動、諧波及備援輔機需求尚未加入。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Starting, harmonics and backup auxiliary demand remain excluded.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「備援電源連續千瓦足夠，就代表所有泵可以同時順利啟動。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Adequate continuous backup kilowatts guarantee that all pumps can start simultaneously.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把千瓦直接當千伏安會低估電氣容量，忽略啟動可能造成連鎖跳脫；備援發電機若與主配電共處易淹位置，也可能在需要時一起失效。","textEn":"Equating kilowatts with kilovolt-amperes understates electrical capacity, and omitted starting demand can trigger cascading trips. A backup generator sharing a flood-prone location with main distribution can fail at the same time it is needed.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「實功率視在功率與備援機理與驗證」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Real apparent and backup power mechanism and verification\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","閘門兩側淨水壓只需把水位差平方，與各側實際水深無關。","把千瓦直接當千伏安會低估電氣容量，忽略啟動可能造成連鎖跳脫；備援發電機若與主配電共處易淹位置，也可能在需要時一起失效。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Net gate pressure depends only on squared level difference, not the individual water depths.","Equating kilowatts with kilovolt-amperes understates electrical capacity, and omitted starting demand can trigger cascading trips."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把千瓦直接當千伏安會低估電氣容量，忽略啟動可能造成連鎖跳脫；備援發電機若與主配電共處易淹位置，也可能在需要時一起失效。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Equating kilowatts with kilovolt-amperes understates electrical capacity, and omitted starting demand can trigger cascading trips. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b270-v15-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「外水倒灌與閘門界面機理與驗證」與「單機停用與整站能力機理與驗證」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Backflow and gate interfaces mechanism and verification\" and \"Unit outage and station capability mechanism and verification\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b270-v15-33","title":"外水倒灌與閘門界面機理與驗證：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Backflow and gate interfaces mechanism and verification: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-32"],"objective":"說明「外水倒灌與閘門界面」如何影響防洪抽水站機組整合的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Backflow and gate interfaces” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Flood-pumping-station integration”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"外水高於內水時，重力出口可能成為倒灌通道，閘門和止回構件的作用必須與抽排路徑協調。兩側水壓的差額決定部分靜水載荷，但實際關閉還涉及摩擦、浮物、動水與機構力；把閘門關閉訊號當成水密保證，會掩蓋漏水或位置感測錯誤。本例為同底高程直立矩形門兩側靜水合力差，不含動水與摩擦，也不直接給出致動器推力或關閉時機。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「外水倒灌與閘門界面」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"When receiving water exceeds interior stage, a gravity outlet can become a backflow path, requiring coordination of gates and check devices with pumping routes. Differential hydrostatic pressure supplies part of the static load, but closure also involves friction, debris, moving water and actuator forces. A closed indication is not proof of watertightness or correct position sensing. The example is the difference in hydrostatic resultants on a vertical rectangular gate with a common bottom datum. It excludes flow and friction and does not specify actuator force or closure timing. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Backflow and gate interfaces” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設水重度γ=9.81 kN/m³、門寬b=2 m、外水深ho=3 m、內水深hi=1 m，淨力F=γb(ho²−hi²)/2=78.48 kN。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume γ=9.81 kN/m³, gate width b=2 m, outside depth ho=3 m and inside hi=1 m.","failure":"常見誤解：「閘門兩側淨水壓只需把水位差平方，與各側實際水深無關。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Net gate pressure depends only on squared level difference, not the individual water depths.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「外水倒灌與閘門界面」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Backflow and gate interfaces”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-33-k1","title":"外水倒灌與閘門界面機理與驗證","titleEn":"Backflow and gate interfaces mechanism and verification","text":"外水高於內水時，重力出口可能成為倒灌通道，閘門和止回構件的作用必須與抽排路徑協調。兩側水壓的差額決定部分靜水載荷，但實際關閉還涉及摩擦、浮物、動水與機構力；把閘門關閉訊號當成水密保證，會掩蓋漏水或位置感測錯誤。","textEn":"When receiving water exceeds interior stage, a gravity outlet can become a backflow path, requiring coordination of gates and check devices with pumping routes. Differential hydrostatic pressure supplies part of the static load, but closure also involves friction, debris, moving water and actuator forces.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：閘門兩側淨水壓只需把水位差平方，與各側實際水深無關。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Net gate pressure depends only on squared level difference, not the individual water depths. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「外水倒灌與閘門界面機理與驗證」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Backflow and gate interfaces mechanism and verification\" is correct?","options":["外水高於內水時，重力出口可能成為倒灌通道，閘門和止回構件的作用必須與抽排路徑協調。","閘門兩側淨水壓只需把水位差平方，與各側實際水深無關。","設有一台備用泵就能保證抽水站任何單一故障都不減排水量。"],"optionsEn":["When receiving water exceeds interior stage, a gravity outlet can become a backflow path, requiring coordination of gates and check devices with pumping routes.","Net gate pressure depends only on squared level difference, not the individual water depths.","One spare pump guarantees unchanged station discharge under every single failure."],"answer":0,"explanation":"外水高於內水時，重力出口可能成為倒灌通道，閘門和止回構件的作用必須與抽排路徑協調。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"When receiving water exceeds interior stage, a gravity outlet can become a backflow path, requiring coordination of gates and check devices with pumping routes. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b270-v15-34","title":"外水倒灌與閘門界面機理與驗證：定量估算","titleEn":"Backflow and gate interfaces mechanism and verification: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「外水倒灌與閘門界面」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Backflow and gate interfaces” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設水重度γ=9.81 kN/m³、門寬b=2 m、外水深ho=3 m、內水深hi=1 m，淨力F=γb(ho²−hi²)/2=78.48 kN。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume γ=9.81 kN/m³, gate width b=2 m, outside depth ho=3 m and inside hi=1 m. Net force F=γb(ho²−hi²)/2=78.48 kN. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：核對門底和兩側水位基準，將位置回饋、實際行程及漏流量交叉檢查。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check gate-bottom and water-level datums, comparing position feedback with physical travel and leakage.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設水重度γ=9.81 kN/m³、門寬b=2 m、外水深ho=3 m、內水深hi=1 m，淨力F=γb(ho²−hi²)/2=78.48 kN。","textEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume γ=9.81 kN/m³, gate width b=2 m, outside depth ho=3 m and inside hi=1 m. Net force F=γb(ho²−hi²)/2=78.48 kN.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「外水倒灌與閘門界面機理與驗證」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Backflow and gate interfaces mechanism and verification\", which statement holds?","options":["防洪泵在所有外河水位下都會維持同一銘牌流量。","原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設水重度γ=9.81 kN/m³、門寬b=2 m、外水深ho=3 m、內水深hi=1 m，淨力F=γb(ho²−hi²)/2=78.48 kN。","水力功率就是抽水站電表功率，不必計入馬達和泵的損失。"],"optionsEn":["A flood pump maintains the same nameplate flow at every receiving-river level.","Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume γ=9.81 kN/m³, gate width b=2 m, outside depth ho=3 m and inside hi=1 m.","Hydraulic power equals metered station power without pump or motor losses."],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設水重度γ=9.81 kN/m³、門寬b=2 m、外水深ho=3 m、內水深hi=1 m，淨力F=γb(ho²−hi²)/2=78.48 kN。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume γ=9.81 kN/m³, gate width b=2 m, outside depth ho=3 m and inside hi=1 m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b270-v15-35","title":"外水倒灌與閘門界面機理與驗證：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Backflow and gate interfaces mechanism and verification: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「外水倒灌與閘門界面」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Backflow and gate interfaces” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"核對門底和兩側水位基準，將位置回饋、實際行程及漏流量交叉檢查。測試狀態介面時保留閘門與泵的時間紀錄，並依核准操作文件確認不會形成封閉抽排或倒灌路徑。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check gate-bottom and water-level datums, comparing position feedback with physical travel and leakage. Retain gate and pump timestamps during interface tests, and use approved operating documentation to verify that transitions do not create a blocked discharge or backflow path. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：畫出兩側三角壓力圖並相減，和只用水位差平方的錯誤結果比較。另列位置訊號與實際漏水兩種驗證，說明它們為何不能互相代替。","observationEn":"Site practice: Draw and subtract the two triangular pressure diagrams, comparing the result with the incorrect squared-level-difference method. Separately list position-signal and leakage checks, explaining why neither substitutes for the other.","failure":"注意干擾：只算外側三角水壓會漏掉內側抵銷，誤用水位差平方則不能代替兩水深平方差；關閉回饋失真或漂流物夾住時，抽水站仍可能持續承受倒灌。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Using only outside pressure omits interior opposition, while squaring the level difference cannot replace the difference of squared depths. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"核對門底和兩側水位基準，將位置回饋、實際行程及漏流量交叉檢查。測試狀態介面時保留閘門與泵的時間紀錄，並依核准操作文件確認不會形成封閉抽排或倒灌路徑。","textEn":"Check gate-bottom and water-level datums, comparing position feedback with physical travel and leakage. Retain gate and pump timestamps during interface tests, and use approved operating documentation to verify that transitions do not create a blocked discharge or backflow path.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"畫出兩側三角壓力圖並相減，和只用水位差平方的錯誤結果比較。另列位置訊號與實際漏水兩種驗證，說明它們為何不能互相代替。","textEn":"Draw and subtract the two triangular pressure diagrams, comparing the result with the incorrect squared-level-difference method. Separately list position-signal and leakage checks, explaining why neither substitutes for the other.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「外水倒灌與閘門界面機理與驗證」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Backflow and gate interfaces mechanism and verification\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","啟停週期等於調節容積除以泵流量，入流大小完全無關。","核對門底和兩側水位基準，將位置回饋、實際行程及漏流量交叉檢查。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","The start-stop cycle equals regulating volume divided by pump flow and is independent of inflow.","Check gate-bottom and water-level datums, comparing position feedback with physical travel and leakage."],"answer":2,"explanation":"核對門底和兩側水位基準，將位置回饋、實際行程及漏流量交叉檢查。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check gate-bottom and water-level datums, comparing position feedback with physical travel and leakage. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b270-v15-36","title":"外水倒灌與閘門界面機理與驗證：失效診斷","titleEn":"Backflow and gate interfaces mechanism and verification: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「外水倒灌與閘門界面」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Backflow and gate interfaces” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"只算外側三角水壓會漏掉內側抵銷，誤用水位差平方則不能代替兩水深平方差；關閉回饋失真或漂流物夾住時，抽水站仍可能持續承受倒灌。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Using only outside pressure omits interior opposition, while squaring the level difference cannot replace the difference of squared depths. False closed feedback or trapped debris can leave a backflow path despite the station’s indicated state. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：本例為同底高程直立矩形門兩側靜水合力差，不含動水與摩擦，也不直接給出致動器推力或關閉時機。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: It excludes flow and friction and does not specify actuator force or closure timing.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「閘門兩側淨水壓只需把水位差平方，與各側實際水深無關。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Net gate pressure depends only on squared level difference, not the individual water depths.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只算外側三角水壓會漏掉內側抵銷，誤用水位差平方則不能代替兩水深平方差；關閉回饋失真或漂流物夾住時，抽水站仍可能持續承受倒灌。","textEn":"Using only outside pressure omits interior opposition, while squaring the level difference cannot replace the difference of squared depths. False closed feedback or trapped debris can leave a backflow path despite the station’s indicated state.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「外水倒灌與閘門界面機理與驗證」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Backflow and gate interfaces mechanism and verification\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["只算外側三角水壓會漏掉內側抵銷，誤用水位差平方則不能代替兩水深平方差；關閉回饋失真或漂流物夾住時，抽水站仍可能持續承受倒灌。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","設有一台備用泵就能保證抽水站任何單一故障都不減排水量。"],"optionsEn":["Using only outside pressure omits interior opposition, while squaring the level difference cannot replace the difference of squared depths.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","One spare pump guarantees unchanged station discharge under every single failure."],"answer":0,"explanation":"只算外側三角水壓會漏掉內側抵銷，誤用水位差平方則不能代替兩水深平方差；關閉回饋失真或漂流物夾住時，抽水站仍可能持續承受倒灌。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using only outside pressure omits interior opposition, while squaring the level difference cannot replace the difference of squared depths. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b270-v15-37","title":"單機停用與整站能力機理與驗證：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Unit outage and station capability mechanism and verification: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-36"],"objective":"說明「單機停用與整站能力」如何影響防洪抽水站機組整合的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Unit outage and station capability” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Flood-pumping-station integration”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"備援台數只有在實際揚程、電源和管路條件下才有意義，保留一台泵不代表任何故障都能維持完整排水。多台可能共用變壓器、閘門、攔污設備或控制，因此機械可用性不等於整站可用性；故障情境應把剩餘排量與儲水時間一起評估，並辨認共因失效。本例每台排量已指定為相同實際揚程下的可用量，假設停機不改變其他台工作點；真實並聯工況須重新求解。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「單機停用與整站能力」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Spare-unit counts matter only at actual head, electrical and pipe conditions. One spare does not preserve full drainage for every fault. Units can share a transformer, gate, screen or controller, so mechanical availability is not station availability. Failure scenarios should compare retained flow with storage time and identify common causes across the complete system. Each unit’s stated flow is available at the same actual head, and an outage is assumed not to shift other operating points. Real parallel-system performance must be solved again. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Unit outage and station capability” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設三台各可排2.0 m³/s、需求5.0 m³/s；一台停用後可用4.0 m³/s，瞬時缺口為1.0 m³/s。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume three units each available at 2.0 m³/s and demand 5.0 m³/s.","failure":"常見誤解：「設有一台備用泵就能保證抽水站任何單一故障都不減排水量。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"One spare pump guarantees unchanged station discharge under every single failure.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「單機停用與整站能力」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Unit outage and station capability”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-37-k1","title":"單機停用與整站能力機理與驗證","titleEn":"Unit outage and station capability mechanism and verification","text":"備援台數只有在實際揚程、電源和管路條件下才有意義，保留一台泵不代表任何故障都能維持完整排水。多台可能共用變壓器、閘門、攔污設備或控制，因此機械可用性不等於整站可用性；故障情境應把剩餘排量與儲水時間一起評估，並辨認共因失效。","textEn":"Spare-unit counts matter only at actual head, electrical and pipe conditions. One spare does not preserve full drainage for every fault.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：設有一台備用泵就能保證抽水站任何單一故障都不減排水量。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: One spare pump guarantees unchanged station discharge under every single failure. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「單機停用與整站能力機理與驗證」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Unit outage and station capability mechanism and verification\" is correct?","options":["設有一台備用泵就能保證抽水站任何單一故障都不減排水量。","備援台數只有在實際揚程、電源和管路條件下才有意義，保留一台泵不代表任何故障都能維持完整排水。","泵的標示總流量大於平均雨水流量，就能保證任何洪水不積水。"],"optionsEn":["One spare pump guarantees unchanged station discharge under every single failure.","Spare-unit counts matter only at actual head, electrical and pipe conditions.","Total labeled pump flow above mean runoff guarantees no flooding in any event."],"answer":1,"explanation":"備援台數只有在實際揚程、電源和管路條件下才有意義，保留一台泵不代表任何故障都能維持完整排水。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Spare-unit counts matter only at actual head, electrical and pipe conditions. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b270-v15-38","title":"單機停用與整站能力機理與驗證：定量估算","titleEn":"Unit outage and station capability mechanism and verification: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「單機停用與整站能力」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Unit outage and station capability” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設三台各可排2.0 m³/s、需求5.0 m³/s；一台停用後可用4.0 m³/s，瞬時缺口為1.0 m³/s。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume three units each available at 2.0 m³/s and demand 5.0 m³/s. One outage leaves 4.0 m³/s, an instantaneous shortfall of 1.0 m³/s. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：逐一列出單泵、電源、攔污與共同管路故障，確認剩餘流量不是直接沿用正常工況。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: List pump, supply, screen and common-pipe failures, checking that retained flow is not simply copied from normal operation.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設三台各可排2.0 m³/s、需求5.0 m³/s；一台停用後可用4.0 m³/s，瞬時缺口為1.0 m³/s。","textEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume three units each available at 2.0 m³/s and demand 5.0 m³/s. One outage leaves 4.0 m³/s, an instantaneous shortfall of 1.0 m³/s.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「單機停用與整站能力機理與驗證」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Unit outage and station capability mechanism and verification\", which statement holds?","options":["兩台並聯泵的實際排水量必定是單台接原管路時的兩倍。","泵降速一成，整站一定同時少抽一成水且省下固定立方比例電力。","原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設三台各可排2.0 m³/s、需求5.0 m³/s；一台停用後可用4.0 m³/s，瞬時缺口為1.0 m³/s。"],"optionsEn":["Two parallel pumps always deliver twice the single-pump flow through the original system.","Reducing speed ten percent guarantees ten percent less station flow and fixed cube-law energy savings.","Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume three units each available at 2.0 m³/s and demand 5.0 m³/s."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設算例，以下量值用於簡化機理比較：假設三台各可排2.0 m³/s、需求5.0 m³/s；一台停用後可用4.0 m³/s，瞬時缺口為1.0 m³/s。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching example using hypothetical inputs to compare a simplified physical mechanism: Assume three units each available at 2.0 m³/s and demand 5.0 m³/s. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b270-v15-39","title":"單機停用與整站能力機理與驗證：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Unit outage and station capability mechanism and verification: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「單機停用與整站能力」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Unit outage and station capability” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"逐一列出單泵、電源、攔污與共同管路故障，確認剩餘流量不是直接沿用正常工況。以可用儲量演算缺口持續時間，並測試故障旗標和人工接管介面，保存實際限制而非只報備援台數。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"List pump, supply, screen and common-pipe failures, checking that retained flow is not simply copied from normal operation. Route shortfalls through available storage, test fault indication and manual takeover interfaces, and document real limitations rather than reporting only the number of spare units. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：建立至少三種故障的剩餘能力表，將共同電源故障與單泵故障分開。把一個排量缺口轉成池水位變化，說明儲水只能提供有限緩衝而非永久替代抽排。","observationEn":"Site practice: Build retained-capacity cases for at least three failures, separating shared-power loss from a single-pump outage. Convert one flow shortfall into sump rise and explain why storage provides a finite buffer rather than a permanent substitute for pumping.","failure":"注意干擾：三台泵共用一個失效配電盤時，名義備援無法保留排量；以正常單台能力乘剩餘台數也可能忽略新揚程，導致可支撐的洪水時間被高估。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: If three pumps share one failed switchboard, nominal redundancy preserves no flow. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"逐一列出單泵、電源、攔污與共同管路故障，確認剩餘流量不是直接沿用正常工況。以可用儲量演算缺口持續時間，並測試故障旗標和人工接管介面，保存實際限制而非只報備援台數。","textEn":"List pump, supply, screen and common-pipe failures, checking that retained flow is not simply copied from normal operation. Route shortfalls through available storage, test fault indication and manual takeover interfaces, and document real limitations rather than reporting only the number of spare units.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"建立至少三種故障的剩餘能力表，將共同電源故障與單泵故障分開。把一個排量缺口轉成池水位變化，說明儲水只能提供有限緩衝而非永久替代抽排。","textEn":"Build retained-capacity cases for at least three failures, separating shared-power loss from a single-pump outage. Convert one flow shortfall into sump rise and explain why storage provides a finite buffer rather than a permanent substitute for pumping.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「單機停用與整站能力機理與驗證」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Unit outage and station capability mechanism and verification\"?","options":["逐一列出單泵、電源、攔污與共同管路故障，確認剩餘流量不是直接沿用正常工況。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","池水位只要夠高，任何機組組合都不可能出現渦流或汽蝕。"],"optionsEn":["List pump, supply, screen and common-pipe failures, checking that retained flow is not simply copied from normal operation.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Sufficient sump level makes vortices or cavitation impossible for every pump combination."],"answer":0,"explanation":"逐一列出單泵、電源、攔污與共同管路故障，確認剩餘流量不是直接沿用正常工況。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"List pump, supply, screen and common-pipe failures, checking that retained flow is not simply copied from normal operation. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b270-v15-40","title":"單機停用與整站能力機理與驗證：失效診斷","titleEn":"Unit outage and station capability mechanism and verification: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"prerequisiteIds":["b270-v15-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「單機停用與整站能力」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Unit outage and station capability” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"三台泵共用一個失效配電盤時，名義備援無法保留排量；以正常單台能力乘剩餘台數也可能忽略新揚程，導致可支撐的洪水時間被高估。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"If three pumps share one failed switchboard, nominal redundancy preserves no flow. Multiplying normal unit capacity by remaining count may also miss changed head and overstate the duration for which storage can bridge the flood. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：本例每台排量已指定為相同實際揚程下的可用量，假設停機不改變其他台工作點；真實並聯工況須重新求解。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Real parallel-system performance must be solved again.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「設有一台備用泵就能保證抽水站任何單一故障都不減排水量。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"One spare pump guarantees unchanged station discharge under every single failure.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b270-v15-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"三台泵共用一個失效配電盤時，名義備援無法保留排量；以正常單台能力乘剩餘台數也可能忽略新揚程，導致可支撐的洪水時間被高估。","textEn":"If three pumps share one failed switchboard, nominal redundancy preserves no flow. Multiplying normal unit capacity by remaining count may also miss changed head and overstate the duration for which storage can bridge the flood.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]},{"id":"b270-v15-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「單機停用與整站能力機理與驗證」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Unit outage and station capability mechanism and verification\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","三台泵共用一個失效配電盤時，名義備援無法保留排量；以正常單台能力乘剩餘台數也可能忽略新揚程，導致可支撐的洪水時間被高估。","泵的標示總流量大於平均雨水流量，就能保證任何洪水不積水。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","If three pumps share one failed switchboard, nominal redundancy preserves no flow.","Total labeled pump flow above mean runoff guarantees no flooding in any event."],"answer":1,"explanation":"三台泵共用一個失效配電盤時，名義備援無法保留排量；以正常單台能力乘剩餘台數也可能忽略新揚程，導致可支撐的洪水時間被高估。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If three pumps share one failed switchboard, nominal redundancy preserves no flow. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v15s-usace-pumps2020","v15s-usace-westclosure","v15s-dsd-storm","v15s-dsd-sheungwan"],"curriculumVersion":15,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
